      "notes_text": "Customer Note\r\n03.07.2025          15:10:52            Taylor Bledsoe (DIIDF904)\r\n\r\nPer the previous notes, this ticket is resolved closing for now. This ticket can be reopened or continued via copy if further troubleshooting is needed.\r\n__________________\r\n\r\nNote\r\n02.07.2025          13:04:57            Jen Brown (TRJJB112)\r\n\r\nThis issue has been troubleshooted and it was determined that a part of the system must be replaced.\r\nReplacement part has been recommended.  Complaints are monitored for trend monthly for the Product Surveillance Committee (PSC) meeting.\r\n\r\nPlease close complaint upon appropriate resolution for the customer.\r\n\r\n__________________\r\n\r\n\r\nSolution Description\r\n01.07.2025          23:32:21            Talia Nastacio (TNASTACIO)\r\n\r\nSolution Description:\r\nNotes copied from Lauren Koenig for PART PTC PROCESSING RMA FOR: Schick 2.0 remote box\r\n\r\n\r\nFunctional (Yes/No): No\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n__________________\r\nCustomer Note\r\n01.07.2025          10:56:09             CPIC_SIMO (CPIC_SIMO)\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nIssue Reported: no response\r\n\r\nEquipment Type and Model: Schick 2.0 remote box\r\n\r\nSerial Number: 9029090290\r\nDOP 12-22-15\r\nEXP 12-22-18\r\n\r\nquoted $885 + tax\r\n\r\nAcquisition Software & Version: ES v 23.10\r\n\r\nIssue in One or All Rooms: all\r\n\r\nOther Sensors work with working Remo\r\ntes in Room(s) with Issue: yes\r\n\r\nPC Name: op2\r\n\r\nSchick Driver Version (Programs and features):\r\n\r\nRemote FW/FPGA Version: _n/a_ Sensor F\r\nW Version:  _____\r\n\r\nIf Remote Issue:\r\n\r\n2.0 or 3.0: Tried Different USB Cable/USB Port/Bypassed USB hubs/Extenders: y\r\n\r\n3.0 Remote: Trie\r\nd on a 3.0 AND 2.0 USB port/cable clip connected:\r\n\r\nIf Sensor Issue, Replaced Elastomer:\r\n\r\nIf Sensor Issue, Tried Different Sensor Cab\r\nle:\r\n\r\nIf no response to radiation, confirmed Xray Head Functional:\r\n\r\nAdditional Troubleshooting Steps/Notes:\r\n\r\nPART PTC PROCESSING RMA\r\nFOR: Schick 2.0 remote box\r\n\r\n+++\r\n+++\r\n\r\n__________________\r\n\r\nProblem Description\r\n01.07.2025          10:56:08             CPIC_SIMO (CPIC_SIMO)\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nIssue Reported: no response\r\n\r\nEquipment Type and Model: Schick 2.0 remote box\r\n\r\nSerial Number: 9029090290\r\nDOP 12-22-15\r\nEXP 12-22-18\r\n\r\nquoted $885 + tax\r\n\r\nAcquisition Software & Version: ES v 23.10\r\n\r\nIssue in One or All Rooms: all\r\n\r\nOther Sensors work with working Remo\r\ntes in Room(s) with Issue: yes\r\n\r\nPC Name: op2\r\n\r\nSchick Driver Version (Programs and features):\r\n\r\nRemote FW/FPGA Version: _n/a_ Sensor F\r\nW Version:  _____\r\n\r\nIf Remote Issue:\r\n\r\n2.0 or 3.0: Tried Different USB Cable/USB Port/Bypassed USB hubs/Extenders: y\r\n\r\n3.0 Remote: Trie\r\nd on a 3.0 AND 2.0 USB port/cable clip connected:\r\n\r\nIf Sensor Issue, Replaced Elastomer:\r\n\r\nIf Sensor Issue, Tried Different Sensor Cab\r\nle:\r\n\r\nIf no response to radiation, confirmed Xray Head Functional:\r\n\r\nAdditional Troubleshooting Steps/Notes:\r\n\r\nPART PTC PROCESSING RMA\r\nFOR: Schick 2.0 remote box\r\n\r\n+++\r\n+++\r\n\r\n__________________\r\n\r\nLog\r\n01.07.2025          10:56:08             CPIC_SIMO (CPIC_SIMO)",
