\nIssue Reported: Sensor not recognized\r\n\r\nEquipment Type and Model: Schick 33 Sz 2 Sensor\r\n\r\nSerial Number: 2\r\n5055580  XS40450\r\n\r\nAcquisition Software & Version: ES v21.00\r\n\r\nIssue in One or All Rooms: 2 rooms\r\n\r\nOther Sensors work with working Rem\r\notes in Room(s) with Issue: yes\r\n\r\nPC Name: IBREHIM\r\n\r\nSchick Driver Version (Programs and features): Current AE 3.0\r\n\r\nRemote FW/FPGA Ver\r\nsion: 5.1.4Sensor FW Version:  unknown\r\n\r\nIf Remote Issue:\r\n\r\n2.0 or 3.0: Tried Different USB Cable/USB Port/Bypassed USB hubs/Extenders\r\n:\r\n\r\n3.0 Remote: Tried on a 3.0 AND 2.0 USB port/cable clip connected:\r\n\r\nIf Sensor Issue, Replaced Elastomer: yes\r\n\r\nIf Sensor Issue, Tri\r\ned Different Sensor Cable: yes\r\n\r\nIf no response to radiation, confirmed Xray Head Functional:\r\n\r\nAdditional Troubleshooting Steps/Notes\r\n: he tested in multiple rooms and will not work anywhere\r\n\r\nPART PTC PROCESSING RMA FOR: Schick 33 Sz 2 Sensor\r\n\r\n+++\r\n+++\r\n\r\n__________________\r\n\r\nLog\r\n01.07.2025          14:01:32             CPIC_SIMO (CPIC_SIMO)",
