      "notes_text": "Note\r\n31.07.2025          20:38:21            Armando Santacruz (ASANTACRUZ)\r\n\r\n__  Further Action __\r\n------FURTHER ACTION-------  07/31/2025 2:08:18 PM (Dentsply Sirona Charlotte Time)\r\n\r\nCallers Full Name: Jake Green\r\nCallers Phone Number: 2088704216\r\nCallers Role: dealer tech\r\n\r\nWarranty Status:warranty\r\nBilling Previously Accepted:\r\n\r\nProblem Description: sensor drop in IOSS32\r\nhas 4.4 Sidexis running\r\n\r\nTroubleshooting Description: found prereqs missing and updated C++2015-22\r\nStation OP6DR-2024 Sidexis found to want client install ran again as if station was renamed\r\nHub not connecting\r\n\r\nSoftware\r\nIntraoral Sensor Software\r\n3.2.4024.52346\r\nIntraoral Acquisition Application\r\n3.2.412.24207\r\nIntraoral Enhancement Filter\r\n319\r\nAE Enhancement Filter\r\n315\r\n\r\nSensors\r\nSchick 33 / Elite / Xios XG USB\r\n3.2.4024.52346\r\nSchick / Xios XG WiFi\r\n3.2.4024.52346\r\nXios AE / Schick AE USB\r\n3.2.4024.52346\r\n\r\nSolution Description: swapped hub with another SW works fine no issues Hub does the same on other stations freezing. Reinstalled SW on station and other hubs work great\r\nadvising to replace hub and ensure clips are used\r\n\r\npart# 100008290\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nFunctional (Yes/No): yes with temp Hub used\r\n\r\n__________________\r\n\r\nCustomer Note\r\n03.07.2025          15:11:58            Taylor Bledsoe (DIIDF904)\r\n\r\nPer the previous notes, this ticket is resolved closing for now. This ticket can be reopened or continued via copy if further troubleshooting is needed.\r\n__________________\r\n\r\nNote\r\n02.07.2025          13:18:45            Jen Brown (TRJJB112)\r\n\r\nThis issue has been troubleshooted and was determined to be related to software or connectivity related within the office and is considered routine servicing.  These requests are monitored for trend monthly at the Product Surveillance Committee (PSC) meeting.\r\n\r\nPlease close ticket.\r\n\r\n____________