M (Dentsply Sirona Charlotte Time)\r\n\r\nWarranty: NO\r\nDealer on-site: NO\r\nBillable: YES\r\nBilling Accepted:  YES\r\nBilling Approved By:  Joseph Dye,joseph.winnsmiles@gmail.com\r\n90 Day Expiration Date: 09/29/2025\r\n\r\nRemote Access: TV\r\n\r\nPractice Management: SOTA Imaging.\r\nWorkstation(s):\r\nScout Check:\r\n\r\n\r\nTroubleshooting Description:\r\n\r\nUsing SOTA imaging. with IOSS.\r\n\r\nWhen they shoot the sensor it seems to got unready but then the image never comes in...\r\n\r\nSota images logs show the following: <Error> -- 7/1/2025 12:13:02 PM -- Never recieved filtered Schick image. with context: An error has been logged for customer winnsmiles.sotadevices.com with username shallowford.winnsmiles@gmail.com. Error: Never received filtered Schick image. The sensor model is Schick with serial number . The affected PC is DESKTOP-B8P6ETG. Open software when the error occurred:\r\n\r\nStaff says it does not seem to acknowledge that the image was taken...\r\n\r\nTried two sensors and image never comes through...\r\n\r\nThe sensor utility app also refuses to open as well...\r\n\r\nMemory Integrity is off.\r\n\r\nIntraoral sensor log says roughly:\r\n\r\nSystem.IO.FileNotFoundException: Could not load file or assembly Sirona.Schick.Filters.ImageProcessing.x64.dll or one of its dependencies. The specified module could not be found.\r\nFile name: Sirona.Schick.Filters.ImageProcessing.x64.dll\r\n\r\nWhich indicates a missing file. Possible antivirus deleted or blocked.\r\n\r\nHad them disable it.\r\n\r\nReinstalled IOSS.\r\n\r\nStill cannot launch utility...\r\n\r\nPre reqs are missing. Updated pre reqs. Rebooted\r\n\r\nReinstalled IOSS again.\r\n\r\nNow utility opens and sota is able to take images fine...\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n__________________\r\n\r\nLog\r\n01.07.2025          18:41:52            Benjamin Magalhaes (BMAGALHAES)\r\nNote\r\n01.07.2025          18:41:52            Benjamin Magalhaes (BMAGALHAES)\r\n\r\n__ Initial ticket creation __\r\n\r\n__________________",
