      "notes_text": "Customer Note\r\n03.07.2025          15:08:50            Taylor Bledsoe (DIIDF904)\r\n\r\nPer the previous notes, this ticket is resolved closing for now. This ticket can be reopened or continued via copy if further troubleshooting is needed.\r\n__________________\r\n\r\nNote\r\n02.07.2025          12:55:51            Jen Brown (TRJJB112)\r\n\r\nThis issue has been troubleshooted and was determined to be related to software or connectivity related within the office and is considered routine servicing.  These requests are monitored for trend monthly at the Product Surveillance Committee (PSC) meeting.\r\n\r\nPlease close ticket.\r\n\r\n__________________\r\n\r\n\r\nSolution Description\r\n01.07.2025          22:15:01            Elhadji Seye (SELHADJI)\r\n\r\n--------INITIAL LOG-------- 07/01/2025 3:56:47 PM (Dentsply Sirona Charlotte Time)\r\n\r\nWarranty: Yes (New Sensor cable) s/n UL508842\r\nDealer on-site: No\r\nBillable: No\r\nBilling Accepted:\r\nBilling Approved By:\r\n90 Day Expiration Date: 09/29/2025\r\n\r\nRemote Access: Yes\r\nSidexis Version:\r\nServer Location:\r\nPDATA Remote Location:\r\nRCU Location (If Applicable):\r\nPractice Management:\r\nWorkstation(s): Xray-pc\r\nScout Check:\r\n\r\nFirmware:\r\nPlug-in Version:\r\nExposure Count:\r\nUnit IP Address:\r\n\r\nTroubleshooting Details: I remoted in after we discussed about the warranty. I found that they have a new cable last year.\r\nThe Elite remote was flickering in Device manager. I have Ericka disconnected the sensor and the device was stable. I asked her to tighten the sensor cable screws. She did that and now the sensor is reading and taking Xray.\r\n\r\nFunctional Test Successful / Follow Up:\r\n\r\n__________________\r\nProblem Description\r\n01.07.2025          21:56:27            Elhadji Seye (SELHADJI)\r\n\r\nHe said that the sensor is not responding to Xray.\r\n__________________\r\n\r\nLog\r\n01.07.2025          21:55:37            Elhadji Seye (SELHADJI)\r\nNote\r\n01.07.2025          21:55:37            Elhadji Seye (SELHADJI)\r\n\r\n__ Initial ticket creation __\r\n\r\n__________________",
