      "problem_description": "Details: Yesterday we have our digital xrays hooked up. all seem to be running well besides one. now today 4 of them are having 4 d ifferent issues Opti1-PC1 sensor does not pull up on this box. box shows up in AE Usb interface. But the sensor does not just fail s to acquire it. took sensor from OPTI1 and moved to Hygiene 10.  Sensor worked. took box from this room and plugged into other com puters and it did not work asked office to try USB port on back of computer for the box...... Hgien10 this box needed a firmware u pdate. but was able to take an xray with the sensor from Opti1 box sn: 2038789 Hygiene 11 this computer we tried the same sensor(op t1) sensor and it worked. Asked office to take badbox into this room and plug it in. Box still didnt work. 782014713 svjey4c9 Hy giene 12. firmware update on box: this one worked the computer light just wasnt green. opened eaglesoft and it worked. Issue Repo rted: Wont pick up on sensor Equipment Type and Model: Schick USB interface  3.0 Serial Number: 2038789 Acquisition Software & V ersion: Patterson Eaglesoft Issue in One or All Rooms: 1 room. but box stays in room Other Sensors work with working Remotes in R oom(s) with Issue: NO PC Name: OPT1-PC1 Schick Driver Version (Programs and features): AE USB interface Remote FW/FPGA Version: 1 .5.140 Sensor FW Version: NA If Remote Issue: YES 2.0 or 3.0: Tried Different USB Cable/USB Port/Bypassed USB hubs/Extenders: Y 3 .0 Remote: Tried on a 3.0 AND 2.0 USB port/cable clip connected: Y If Sensor Issue, Replaced Elastomer: If Sensor Issue, Tried Dif ferent Sensor Cable: If no response to radiation, confirmed Xray Head Functional: Additional Troubleshooting Steps/Notes: +++ +++ Log",
