rivers are installed here\r\nJFDN-108 is configured to use the old twain setup -- AE USB and CDR twain drivers are installed\r\n\r\nReturned to JFDOP8 and removed the IOSS Driver\r\ndirected her to the section for non-supported drivers and highlighted the ones theyll need\r\nshe will unblock and extract files to install\r\n\r\nFunctional (Yes/No): No\r\n\r\n\r\n__________________\r\n\r\nLog\r\n01.07.2025          22:25:35            Talia Nastacio (TNASTACIO)\r\nNote\r\n01.07.2025          22:25:35            Talia Nastacio (TNASTACIO)\r\n\r\n__ Initial ticket creation __\r\n\r\n__________________",
