      "description_text": "wifi senzor changeover",
      "notes_text": "Customer Note\r\n16.09.2025          11:48:22             CPIC_SIMO (CPIC_SIMO)\r\n\r\nRequest resolved\r\nAfter changing to USB 3.0 module, system works perfectly.\r\n__________________\r\n\r\nCustomer Note\r\n09.09.2025          15:46:04            Romain Berni (ROMBER)\r\n\r\nDears,\r\n\r\nCase can be closed as it can be redden in the notices\r\n__________________\r\n\r\nNote\r\n09.09.2025          13:58:57            Jen Brown (TRJJB112)\r\n\r\nTCS-Please review the additional comments from the customer and move this to closure.\r\n__________________\r\n\r\nCustomer Note\r\n20.08.2025          12:47:11             CPIC_SIMO (CPIC_SIMO)\r\n\r\nAn update to this case - I took the WiFi sensor to another practice that also has a WiFi version but they are still on Windows 10  and it is working fine over there, meaning it stopped working on Windows 11.\r\n\r\n__________________\r\n\r\nCustomer Note\r\n08.07.2025          11:54:28             CPIC_SIMO (CPIC_SIMO)\r\n\r\nDear partners,\r\n\r\ncan you please inform me to which kind of cases does the goodwill transition refers to?\r\n\r\nThank you and best regards,\r\nSlaven\r\n__________________\r\n\r\n\r\nSolution Description\r\n08.07.2025          10:25:59            Romain Berni (ROMBER)\r\n\r\nPlease refer to customer communication via Customer Notes\r\n__________________\r\nCustomer Note\r\n08.07.2025          10:25:59            Romain Berni (ROMBER)\r\n\r\nDear Customer,\r\n\r\nThe order 2278171  is from 2017 and has no warranty anymore, the request is closed accordingly.\r\n__________________\r\n\r\nNote\r\n07.07.2025          14:14:28            Marika Kiss (MARKIS)\r\n\r\nDer Auftrag 2278171 ist vom August 2017 und hat keine Garantie mehr.\r\n__________________\r\n\r\nNote\r\n07.07.2025          13:20:26            Jen Brown (TRJJB112)\r\n\r\nThis issue has been troubleshooted and it was determined that a part of the system must be replaced.\r\nReplacement part has been recommended.  Complaints are monitored for trend monthly for the Product Surveillance Committee (PSC) meeting.\r\n\r\nPlease close complaint upon appropriate resolution for the customer.\r\n\r\n__________________\r\n\r\nNote\r\n04.07.2025          08:33:18            Dominik Kloess (DICUR176)\r\n\r\nHallo,\r\n\r\nder Kunde kann seinen Xios XG Wifi-Sensoren auf Kabel umrüsten.\r\n\r\nDazu benötigt er:\r\n\r\n6404656 Xios XG USB- Modul\r\n6404235 Xios XG USB -Kabel A/B 2m mit Ferrit\r\n\r\nUnd eines hiervon in gewünschter Länge:\r\n\r\n6404169 XIOS XG USB Kabelkit 90cm\r\n6404177 XIOS XG USB Kabelkit 180 cm\r\n6404185 XIOS XG USB Kabelkit 270 cm\r\n\r\nIch kann aber nicht sagen wie das mit Kulanz/Gewährleistung stattfindet. Deshalb bitte übernehmen- Danke\r\n\r\n__________________\r\n\r\nNote\r\n04.07.2025          07:34:07            Steffen Helferich (STEHEL)\r\n\r\nFragen zum Austauschprogramm von Wifi auf USB siehe text unten im Ticket\r\n__________________\r\n\r\nCustomer Note\r\n02.07.2025          15:14:59             CPIC_SIMO (CPIC_SIMO)\r\n\r\nDear partners,\r\n\r\ncustomer has reported that the WiFi sensor has stopped working. I have been to the customers practice and analyzed\r\nthe situation.\r\n\r\nDevice was working normally on a Windows 11 PC with Sidexis 4.4.1.2 and IOSS 3.2 plugin before it stopped working.\r\n\r\n\r\nThey havent changed the router.\r\n\r\nWhen device is switched on it is blinking purple color.\r\n\r\nSensor is not visible in the server web\r\npage.\r\n\r\nIve tested the device with the new sensor and interface battery, checked the firewall settings.\r\n\r\nAs per dental infromation f\r\nrom January 2025 there is a warranty/goodwill transition program available to upgrade from WiFi to USB connection. Please advise if\r\nthis case is qualified for such transition and how to proceed.\r\n\r\nThank you and best reagrds,\r\nSlaven\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n+++\r\n+++\r\n\r\n__________________\r\n\r\nProblem Description\r\n02.07.2025          15:14:58             CPIC_SIMO (CPIC_SIMO)\r\n\r\nDear partners,\r\n\r\ncustomer has reported that the WiFi sensor has stopped working. I have been to the customers practice and analyzed\r\nthe situation.\r\n\r\nDevice was working normally on a Windows 11 PC with Sidexis 4.4.1.2 and IOSS 3.2 plugin before it stopped working.\r\n\r\n\r\nThey havent changed the router.\r\n\r\nWhen device is switched on it is blinking purple color.\r\n\r\nSensor is not visible in the server web\r\npage.\r\n\r\nIve tested the device with the new sensor and interface battery, checked the firewall settings.\r\n\r\nAs per dental infromation f\r\nrom January 2025 there is a warranty/goodwill transition program available to upgrade from WiFi to USB connection. Please advise if\r\nthis case is qualified for such transition and how to proceed.\r\n\r\nThank you and best reagrds,\r\nSlaven\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n+++\r\n+++\r\n\r\n__________________\r\n\r\nLog\r\n02.07.2025          15:14:58             CPIC_SIMO (CPIC_SIMO)",
