      "problem_description": "Dear partners, customer has reported that the WiFi sensor has stopped working. I have been to the customers practice and analyzed the situation. Device was working normally on a Windows 11 PC with Sidexis 4.4.1.2 and IOSS 3.2 plugin before it stopped working. They havent changed the router. When device is switched on it is blinking purple color. Sensor is not visible in the server web page. Ive tested the device with the new sensor and interface battery, checked the firewall settings. As per dental infromation f rom January 2025 there is a warranty/goodwill transition program available to upgrade from WiFi to USB connection. Please advise if this case is qualified for such transition and how to proceed. Thank you and best reagrds, Slaven +++ +++ Log",
      "problem_summary": "wifi senzor changeover",
      "solution_summary": "for the customer. __________________ Note 04.07.2025 08:33:18 Dominik Kloess (DICUR176) Hallo, der Kunde kann seinen Xios XG Wifi-Sensoren auf Kabel umrüsten. Dazu benötigt er: 6404656 Xios XG USB- Modul 6404235 Xios XG USB -Kabel A/B 2m mit Ferrit Und eines hiervon in gewünschter Länge: 6404169 XIOS XG USB Kabelkit 90cm 6404177 XIOS XG USB Kabelkit 180 cm 6404185 XIOS XG USB Kabelkit 270 cm Ich kann aber nicht sagen wie das mit Kulanz/Gewährleistung stattfindet. Deshalb bitte übernehmen- Danke __________________ Note 04.07.2025 07:34:07 Steffen Helferich (STEHEL) Fragen zum Austauschprogramm von Wifi auf USB siehe text unten im Ticket __________________ Customer Note 02.07.2025 15:14:59 CPIC_SIMO (CPIC_SIMO) Dear partners, customer has reported that the WiFi sensor has stopped working. I have been to the customers practice and analyzed the situation. Device was working normally on a Windows 11 PC with Sidexis 4.4.1.2 and IOSS 3.2 plugin before it stopped working. They havent changed the router. When device is switched on it is blinking purple color. Sensor is not visible in the server web page. Ive tested the device with the new sensor and interface battery, checked the firewall settings. As per dental infromation f rom January 2025 there is a warranty/goodwill transition program available to upgrade from WiFi to USB connection. Please advise if this case is qualified for such transition and how to proceed. Thank you and best reagrds, Slaven +++ +++ __________________"
