      "notes_text": "Note\r\n07.07.2025          16:01:42            Talia Nastacio (TNASTACIO)\r\n\r\n__  Further Action __\r\nN\r\nDetails: Inquiry\r\n\r\nFollow Up:\r\nno images attached to confirm image quality concerns\r\nTicket also created under sensor but was found to be the device they use to expose/ release radiation -- device name not provided to confirm if its HD Plus or another manufacturer device\r\n__________________\r\n\r\n\r\nSolution Description\r\n07.07.2025          15:59:37            Talia Nastacio (TNASTACIO)\r\n\r\nper Remy Rainville:\r\nSolution Description:\r\nThe X-ray generator and ac\r\nquisition software function correctly with all other detectors.\r\n\r\nThis strongly suggests a hardware-related fault, possibly tied to t\r\nhe detectors internal electronics\r\n\r\n\r\nFunctional (Yes/No): yes issue unrelated to sensor\r\n\r\n\r\n__________________\r\nCustomer Note\r\n02.07.2025          16:30:33             CPIC_SIMO (CPIC_SIMO)\r\n\r\nWe are experiencing a recurring issue with one of your X-ray detectors. Approximately one out of every three acquisitions results in\r\n a completely white image, while the others appear normal.\r\n\r\nWe have carried out several tests to isolate the problem:\r\n\r\nThe issue is\r\nlimited to this specific detector. Other detectors of the same model work perfectly under identical conditions.\r\n\r\nWe have replaced th\r\ne data and trigger cables, and tested the unit across different acquisition systems  the issue remains.\r\n\r\nThe X-ray generator and ac\r\nquisition software function correctly with all other detectors.\r\n\r\nThis strongly suggests a hardware-related fault, possibly tied to t\r\nhe detectors internal electronics\r\n\r\n+++\r\n+++\r\n\r\n__________________\r\n\r\nProblem Description\r\n02.07.2025          16:30:32             CPIC_SIMO (CPIC_SIMO)\r\n\r\nWe are experiencing a recurring issue with one of your X-ray detectors. Approximately one out of every three acquisitions results 