      "notes_text": "Note\r\n07.07.2025          14:00:46            Jen Brown (TRJJB112)\r\n\r\nThis issue has been troubleshooted and was determined to be related to software or connectivity related within the office and is considered routine servicing.  These requests are monitored for trend monthly at the Product Surveillance Committee (PSC) meeting.\r\n\r\nPlease close ticket.\r\n\r\n__________________\r\n\r\nNote\r\n02.07.2025          23:42:13            Benjamin Magalhaes (BMAGALHAES)\r\n\r\n__  Further Action __\r\n------FURTHER ACTION-------  07/02/2025 4:54:28 PM (Dentsply Sirona Charlotte Time)\r\n\r\nCallers Full Name: Joseph Dye\r\nCallers Phone Number: 276-920-4228\r\nCallers Role:\r\n\r\nWarranty Status:\r\nBilling Previously Accepted:\r\n\r\nProblem Description:\r\n\r\nTroubleshooting Description:\r\n\r\nSensor not being detected on this workstation.\r\n\r\nEach workstation has its own interface and they move sensors around.\r\n\r\nSensor works properly on previous station as stated in ticket\r\n\r\nTried to get same interface and sensor that worked on the other workstation and sensor is still not detected.\r\n\r\nCustomer claims exact combination worked on another workstation.(The one we worked on)\r\n\r\nMemory integrity is off.\r\n\r\n\r\nSo both known working interface and sensor shows sensor not detected on this workstation. Where they work on others.\r\n\r\nFully removed IOSS and reinstalled. Pre reqs already check out.\r\n\r\n\r\nInterface is working and being detected it passes diagnostic tests sensor never does.\r\n\r\nHe brought back same exact setup cable sensor and interface to another workstation and it worked right off the bat.\r\n\r\n\r\nIssues definitely isolated to this workstation.\r\n\r\nIT is a thin tower which likely has a small power supply.\r\n\r\nSymptoms are in line with limited power to sensor.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nSolution Description:\r\n\r\nAdvised to try a powered usb HUB.\r\n\r\nFunctional (Yes/No): YES\r\n\r\n__________________\r\n\r\nProblem Description\r\n02.07.2025          21:44:17            Michael Hall (MHALL)\r\n\r\n--------INITIAL LOG-------- 07/02/2025 3:43:07 PM (Dentsply Sirona Charlotte Time)\r\n\r\nWarranty: yes\r\nDealer on-site: no\r\nBillable: no\r\nBilling Accepted:\r\nBilling Approved By:\r\n90 Day Expiration Date: 09/30/2025\r\n\r\nRemote Access: yes\r\nSidexis Version: 4.3.1\r\nServer Location:\r\nPDATA Remote Location:\r\nRCU Location (If Applicable):\r\nPractice Management:\r\nWorkstation(s):\r\nScout Check:\r\n\r\nFirmware:\r\nPlug-in Version:\r\nExposure Count:\r\nUnit IP Address:\r\n\r\nTroubleshooting Description: ioss issue updated pre-requisites and system is working\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n__________________\r\n\r\nSolution Description\r\n02.07.2025          21:44:17            Michael Hall (MHALL)\r\n\r\nSolution Description: updated pre-requisites\r\n\r\n\r\nFunctional (Yes/No):yes\r\n\r\n\r\n__________________\r\nNote\r\n02.07.2025          21:41:38            Michael Hall (MHALL)\r\n\r\n__ Initial ticket creation __\r\n\r\n__________________\r\n\r\n\r\nLog\r\n02.07.2025          21:41:37            Michael Hall (MHALL)",
