      "notes_text": "Note\r\n07.07.2025          14:06:00            Jen Brown (TRJJB112)\r\n\r\nThis issue has been troubleshooted and was determined to be related to software or connectivity related within the office and is considered routine servicing.  These requests are monitored for trend monthly at the Product Surveillance Committee (PSC) meeting.\r\n\r\nPlease close ticket.\r\n\r\n__________________\r\n\r\nNote\r\n03.07.2025          20:30:23            Talia Nastacio (TNASTACIO)\r\n\r\n__  Further Action __\r\nN\r\nDetails: Inquiry\r\n\r\nFollow Up:\r\nTim Plakon (DS Rep) called to inquire about why the office is requesting him for a registration key\r\n\r\ninformed him of the IOSS driver compatibility and their request to use Acteon\r\nThe IOSS driver is preferred and compatible with their new sensors, but as I had informed them with the initial install call, their old twain setup is not supported\r\n\r\nI provided him the names of the drivers I had highlighted for the office to install but also clarified the reason why they were requesting the reg key = to upgrade to 4.4 and take exposures directly through Sidexis\r\n\r\nhe will inform office\r\n__________________\r\n\r\nNote\r\n03.07.2025          17:20:14            Seth Woodward (SWOODWARD)\r\n\r\n__  Further Action __\r\n------FURTHER ACTION-------  07/03/2025 11:06:58 AM (Dentsply Sirona Charlotte Time)\r\n\r\nCallers Full Name: Samira Sanchez\r\nCallers Phone Number: 720-322-4054\r\nCallers Role: office\r\n\r\nWarranty Status: Yes\r\nBilling Previously Accepted: Na\r\n\r\nProblem Description: Acteon support is on the line with us as well, the version the office is running will not support the IOSS driver\r\n\r\nTroubleshooting Description: logged on to OP-3\r\nthey need sidexis and twain installed to capture within Acreon\r\n\r\nSolution Description: they are going to order the no charge version of sidexis to get a registration number\r\n\r\n\r\nFunctional (Yes/No): No\r\n\r\n__________________\r\n\r\n\r\nSolution Description\r\n02.07.2025          23:34:01            Talia Nastacio (TNASTACIO)\r\n\r\nSolution Description:\r\nConnected to OP-3 and installed IOSS driver\r\nACTEON will not open through Dentrix integration\r\nshe launched independently but sensor is not recognized\r\n\r\ninformed her it may still rely on the older drivers and directed her to the drivers they will need, pointing out the non-supported notice\r\nshe will reach out to Acteon to confirm and also have Dentrix integration fixed\r\n\r\nFunctional (Yes/No): No\r\n\r\n\r\n__________________\r\nProblem Description\r\n02.07.2025          23:26:54            Talia Nastacio (TNASTACIO)\r\n\r\n--------INITIAL LOG-------- 07/02/2025 5:17:49 PM (Dentsply Sirona Charlotte Time)\r\n\r\nWarranty: Yes\r\nDealer on-site: No\r\nBillable: No\r\nBilling Accepted: N/A\r\nBilling Approved By: N/A\r\n\r\nRemote Access: YEs\r\nSidexis Version: N/A\r\nServer Location: N/A\r\nPDATA Remote Location: N/A\r\nRCU Location (If Applicable): N/A\r\nPractice Management: Dentrix to Acteon integration\r\nWorkstation(s): OP-3\r\nScout Check: Yes\r\n\r\nFirmware: 1.5.121 to 1.5.141\r\nPlug-in Version: 3.2\r\nExposure Count: N/A\r\nUnit IP Address: N/A\r\n\r\nTroubleshooting Description:\r\nNew sensor install, they need the driver for twain capture\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n__________________\r\n\r\nLog\r\n02.07.2025          23:17:52            Talia Nastacio (TNASTACIO)\r\nNote\r\n02.07.2025          23:17:52            Talia Nastacio (TNASTACIO)\r\n\r\n__ Initial ticket creation __\r\n\r\n__________________",
