ages  they have two remotes and two sensors they move bewteen rooms\r\nNo cable clips\r\nThe are using the wrong filters for Schick for Schick 33 they where using the wrong Schick filter in Dentrix which was the Schick AE filter\r\n\r\n\r\nTroubleshooting Description:\r\n\r\nThey are using Dentrix ascend with too many filter options.\r\nThey prefer Endo\r\nSuggest Twain with Endo and the user would have to disable the No Enhance with\r\n\r\nThey need the Cable clip\r\nUse need to use one option twain or direct and get use to the work flow with The cable clip attached becuase the\r\nturned off power manage\r\n They will use The Schick filters in Dentrix at General or Endo\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n__________________\r\n\r\nLog\r\n03.07.2025          16:14:20            David Mottley (DMOTTLEY)\r\nNote\r\n03.07.2025          16:14:20            David Mottley (DMOTTLEY)\r\n\r\n__ Initial ticket creation __\r\n\r\n__________________",
