      "notes_text": "Note\r\n11.07.2025          21:41:43            Jerome Miller (JMILLER1)\r\n\r\n__  Further Action __\r\n------FURTHER ACTION-------  07/11/2025 3:07:55 PM (Dentsply Sirona Charlotte Time)\r\n\r\nCallers Full Name: Jeffrey Connell\r\nCallers Phone Number:\r\nCallers Role: Dr\r\n\r\nWarranty Status:Warranty\r\nBilling Previously Accepted: no\r\n\r\nProblem Description: Help getting sensors to working in Curve\r\n\r\nTroubleshooting Description: 3.2 IOS already installed\r\n\r\n\r\nSolution Description:Conferenced in With Curve and they set the new drivers to work with IOS3.2\r\n\r\nAffd-ops5 and ops4\r\n\r\nFunctional (Yes/No):Tested and working\r\n__________________\r\n\r\nNote\r\n09.07.2025          19:28:43            Talia Nastacio (TNASTACIO)\r\n\r\n__  Further Action __\r\nN\r\nDetails: Inquiry\r\n\r\nFollow Up:\r\nrep called to inquire about the ticket history and if the doctor calls this number if he will be assisted\r\n\r\nconfirmed and also informed him of the call history showing hes called multiple times to ask the same question and would be best to call us when hes ready for us to install the s/w\r\n\r\nrep: David Catanese is requesting issue to be escalated\r\noffered him the escalation team email -- refused\r\nhe would prefer to speak to supervisor -- reached out but they are not available\r\n\r\ninformed him they will reach out when available\r\n__________________\r\n\r\nNote\r\n09.07.2025          17:53:06            Tou Lee Yang (TYANG)\r\n\r\n__  Further Action __\r\nContact Name: David C.\r\nContact Tel: Connected over via ext. 66434\r\nContact ID (Tech, Dealer, Customer, DS, Other): Customer\r\n\r\nWarranty or Non-Warranty Call: Inquiry\r\n\r\nProblem Description:\r\nDavid called in and inquired about ticket 1255215.\r\nHe said that the doctor has Eaglesoft software and will be installing a product called Kerr?\r\nThe doctor will need help with his Schick drivers.\r\n\r\nTroubleshooting Steps:\r\nI explained that when the doctor is ready, he can call us back.\r\nIf the doctor provides this ticket number, our Imaging team will be able to assist with the Schick drivers.\r\n\r\nDavid understood and will relay this information to the doctor.\r\n\r\n\r\nUpdated ticket to document todays call.\r\n__________________\r\n\r\nNote\r\n07.07.2025          16:51:25            Talia Nastacio (TNASTACIO)\r\n\r\n__  Further Action __\r\nN\r\nDetails: Inquiry\r\n\r\nFollow Up:\r\nDoctor called back to confirm the process but also was not ready to install\r\n\r\ninformed him he can call us when ready to start the migration/ install process\r\n\r\nhe was frustrated that he did not hear a response from email and also that hold time on Friday was impossible to get through to us\r\ninformed him of email and phone priority and its best to call in, also reminded him we were closed on Friday due to holiday\r\n\r\n\r\n__________________\r\n\r\nProblem Description\r\n03.07.2025          17:39:07            Austin Stevens (ASTEVENS)\r\n\r\n--------INITIAL LOG-------- 07/03/2025 11:31:22 AM (Dentsply Sirona Charlotte Time)\r\n\r\nWarranty: Unknown (PTC response pending - Schick portal down at the time of this ticket)\r\nDealer on-site: No\r\nBillable: No\r\nDetails: Inquiry\r\n\r\nFollow Up:  Dr Connell reached out requesting information on transitioning from Eagelsofts direct integration to Curve Hero.\r\nDr Connell is currently using Eaglesoft and transitioning to Curve Hero later this month.\r\n- -\r\nI explained for now, Curve Hero will require Sidexis, IOSS, and the Sitwain driver which we can assist with installing.\r\nHe has a call with someone at Curve Hero and I recommended asking for an ETA on their integration with the IOSS plug-in.\r\n- -\r\nHe will be calling before the go-live date for the migration to use one overflow room to install Sidexis / IOSS / Sitwain to make sure it works in Curve Hero before making the full transition.\r\n- -\r\nHe wants to schedule a date for the install with someone, I recommended he reach out to the UnitedStatesRCO-Imaging-Support@dentsplysirona.com email, or to call in the day theyre ready to test with this ticket #.\r\n\r\n__________________\r\n\r\nSolution Description\r\n03.07.2025          17:39:07            Austin Stevens (ASTEVENS)\r\n\r\nSolution Description: Information provided on Sidexis, IOSS, and Sitwain integration.\r\n\r\n\r\nFunctional (Yes/No): Yes\r\n\r\n\r\n__________________\r\n\r\nLog\r\n03.07.2025          17:07:07            Austin Stevens (ASTEVENS)\r\nNote\r\n03.07.2025          17:07:07            Austin Stevens (ASTEVENS)\r\n\r\n__ Initial ticket creation __\r\n\r\n__________________",
