      "problem_description": "Warranty: Unknown (PTC response pending - Schick portal down at the time of this ticket) Dealer on-site: No Billable: No Details: Inquiry Follow Up:  Dr Connell reached out requesting information on transitioning from Eagelsofts direct integration to Curve Hero. Dr Connell is currently using Eaglesoft and transitioning to Curve Hero later this month. - - I explained for now, Curve Hero will require Sidexis, IOSS, and the Sitwain driver which we can assist with installing. He has a call with someone at Curve Hero and I recommended asking for an ETA on their integration with the IOSS plug-in. - - He will be calling before the go-live date for the migration to use one overflow room to install Sidexis / IOSS / Sitwain to make sure it works in Curve Hero before making the full transition. - - He wants to schedule a date for the install with someone, I recommended he reach out to the UnitedStatesRCO-Imaging-Support@dentsplysirona.com email, or to call in the day theyre ready to test with this ticket #.",
