      "notes_text": "Problem Description\r\n03.07.2025          21:52:09            Taylor Bledsoe (DIIDF904)\r\n\r\n--------INITIAL LOG-------- 07/03/2025 3:50:10 PM (Dentsply Sirona Charlotte Time)\r\n\r\nWarranty: NO\r\nDealer on-site: NO\r\nBillable: YES\r\nBilling Accepted: No\r\nDetails: Inquiry\r\n\r\nFollow Up:\r\n\r\nPractice has an out of warranty CDR Elite sensor and 2.0 hub, as well as a XIOS XG sensor, not FDA certified.\r\n\r\nThe issue is the CDR Elite does function, but not on one specific computer. that makes this software support, so after asking about their second sensor and discovering it was XIOS XG, I informed them it is not supported/FDA approved.\r\n__________________\r\n\r\nSolution Description\r\n03.07.2025          21:52:09            Taylor Bledsoe (DIIDF904)\r\n\r\nCustomer denied billing to cover software support under the CDR Elite sensor. I forwarded some links via email to dsgo.to/schick and /howto.\r\n__________________\r\n\r\nLog\r\n03.07.2025          21:52:09            Taylor Bledsoe (DIIDF904)\r\n\r\nNote\r\n03.07.2025          21:52:09            Taylor Bledsoe (DIIDF904)\r\n\r\n__ Initial ticket creation __\r\n\r\n__________________",
