      "notes_text": "Note\r\n08.07.2025          15:36:57            Jean Lagraba (DIUQY284)\r\n\r\n__  Further Action __\r\n------FURTHER ACTION-------  07/08/2025 9:35:12 AM (Dentsply Sirona Charlotte Time)\r\n\r\nCallers Full Name: Husam Alabsi\r\nCallers Phone Number: 5145159613\r\nCallers Role:  IT\r\n\r\nBilling Previously Accepted:\r\nBilling Accepted:\r\nBilling Approved By:\r\n\r\nFurther Action Issue / Request:  he had issues on a laptop that had an unknown errro when trying to capture with an intraoral sensor in curve hero.\r\n\r\nTroubleshooting Details: from previous notes they had done multiple sidexis 4.4 installs on 3 laptops. i checked the Services and foundthat the Sidexis service was not running whioch cause the intraoral service not to run either,\r\nonce running i was able to connect to the sensor and perform a test connection. Test passed. explained why the software was not working and he took notes.\r\n\r\nFunctional Test Successful / Follow Up:\r\n\r\n__________________\r\n\r\nNote\r\n08.07.2025          13:15:06            Jen Brown (TRJJB112)\r\n\r\nThis issue has been troubleshooted and was determined to be related to software or connectivity related within the office and is considered routine servicing.  These requests are monitored for trend monthly at the Product Surveillance Committee (PSC) meeting.\r\n\r\nPlease close ticket.\r\n\r\n__________________\r\n\r\nNote\r\n07.07.2025          21:09:06            Austin Stevens (ASTEVENS)\r\n\r\n__  Further Action __\r\nOutbound 3\r\n__________________\r\n\r\nNote\r\n07.07.2025          20:48:50            Austin Stevens (ASTEVENS)\r\n\r\n__  Further Action __\r\nOutbound 2\r\n__________________\r\n\r\nNote\r\n07.07.2025          20:48:32            Austin Stevens (ASTEVENS)\r\n\r\n__  Further Action __\r\nOutbound 1\r\n__________________\r\n\r\nProblem Description\r\n07.07.2025          20:48:01            Austin Stevens (ASTEVENS)\r\n\r\n--------INITIAL LOG-------- 07/07/2025 11:37:15 AM (Dentsply Sirona Charlotte Time)\r\n\r\nWarranty:\r\nDealer on-site: No\r\nBillable: No (Canada)\r\nBilling Accepted:  NA\r\nBilling Approved By: NA\r\n90 Day Expiration Date: 10/05/2025\r\n\r\nRemote Access: Yes\r\nSidexis Version: Sidexis 4.4 (un-licensed)\r\nServer Location:  CHRISTINE\r\nPDATA Remote Location: CHRISTINE\r\nRCU Location (If Applicable): NA\r\nPractice Management: Curve Hero\r\nWorkstation(s): CHRISTINE, R-OFFICELT, LAPTOP-DDFO3OVD\r\nScout Check: No\r\n\r\n\r\nTroubleshooting Description: Husam from the office called requesting help with installing Schick drivers on 4 temporary laptops.\r\nThe office lost internet and are separate hotspots for each laptop.\r\nTheir internet service provider is not able to resolve their internet and they need a backup plan.\r\nTheyre looking to have Schick drivers installed on these laptops.\r\nDue to each laptop being on their own hotspot / network I need to do a standalone install of Sidexis 4.4 (unlicensed).\r\n- -\r\nRemoted into CHRISTINE, LAPTOP-DDFO3OVD, and R-OFFICELT.\r\nSidexis, Sitwain, and IOSS all installed.\r\nX-rays successfully acquired on all three laptops.\r\nWhen their internet is working again they will go back to their PCs that had the legacy driver installed.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n__________________\r\n\r\nSolution Description\r\n07.07.2025          20:48:01            Austin Stevens (ASTEVENS)\r\n\r\nSolution Description: Installed Sidexis, IOSS, Sitwain on all three laptops.\r\nX-rays taken successfully in Curve Hero on each laptop.\r\n\r\nFunctional (Yes/No): Yes\r\n\r\n\r\n__________________\r\n\r\nLog\r\n07.07.2025          17:28:10            Austin Stevens (ASTEVENS)\r\nNote\r\n07.07.2025          17:28:10            Austin Stevens (ASTEVENS)\r\n\r\n__ Initial ticket creation __\r\n\r\n__________________",
