ed\r\nprovided her PN to order replacement\r\n\r\n\r\nFunctional (Yes/No): No\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n__________________\r\n\r\nLog\r\n07.07.2025          17:32:10            Talia Nastacio (TNASTACIO)\r\nNote\r\n07.07.2025          17:32:10            Talia Nastacio (TNASTACIO)\r\n\r\n__ Initial ticket creation __\r\n\r\n__________________",
