      "description_text": "cannot connect to sensor",
      "notes_text": "Note\r\n23.07.2025          18:41:16            David Mottley (DMOTTLEY)\r\n\r\n__  Further Action __\r\n\r\nN\r\nDetails: Inquiry\r\n\r\n\r\nCustomer was calling about the status\r\n\r\nexplained several times Henry schien would have to  order it,\r\nFollow Up:\r\n\r\n__________________\r\n\r\nNote\r\n09.07.2025          22:23:14            Benjamin Magalhaes (BMAGALHAES)\r\n\r\n__  Further Action __\r\n------FURTHER ACTION-------  07/09/2025 3:55:11 PM (Dentsply Sirona Charlotte Time)\r\n\r\nCallers Full Name:\r\nCallers Phone Number:\r\nCallers Role:\r\n\r\nWarranty Status:\r\nBilling Previously Accepted:\r\n\r\nProblem Description:\r\n\r\nTroubleshooting Description:\r\n\r\n\r\nSolution Description:\r\n\r\nNot sure what they mean by IOSS integrator.\r\n\r\nThey are using dexis with twain...\r\n\r\nDexis is not compatible with IOSS not sure and customer says they were recommended IOSS so not sure why..\r\n\r\nSensor is working fine now...\r\n\r\nCustomer gets intermitent sensor not detected.\r\n\r\nThey are using CDR twain with old drivers and dexis...\r\n\r\nCustomer says they were told to call dexis about a Schick integrator.... and dexis has no clue what that is.\r\n\r\nIm guessing there was a communication issue and they were told to ask DEXIS about IOSS\r\n\r\nGot an image of PC and it looks like a thin tower but its not clear.\r\n\r\nThey are getting intermittent issues.\r\n\r\n\r\nThey did have power management on the USB port turned on. This could most definitely explain the intermittent issues as\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nFunctional (Yes/No):YES\r\n\r\n__________________\r\n\r\nNote\r\n08.07.2025          21:59:00            Keenan Jordan (KJORDAN)\r\n\r\n__  Further Action __\r\n------FURTHER ACTION-------  07/08/2025 3:44:37 PM (Dentsply Sirona Charlotte Time)\r\n\r\nCallers Full Name: Shikha Sharma\r\nCallers Phone Number: 4047867616\r\nCallers Role: Doctor\r\n\r\nBilling Previously Accepted:\r\nBilling Accepted:\r\nBilling Approved By:\r\n\r\nFurther Action Issue / Request:\r\n\r\nSensor not working per user\r\n\r\nTroubleshooting Details:\r\n\r\nAttachment\r\n\r\nHad to close the Dexis and reopened.\r\n\r\nWorking now.\r\n\r\nGave information about the IOSS integrator for the Schick sensor.\r\n\r\nFunctional Test Successful / Follow Up:\r\n\r\nOffice was able to take the exposure\r\n\r\nOffice will contact Dexis support about the Schick integrator\r\n\r\n__________________\r\n\r\nNote\r\n08.07.2025          13:20:05            Jen Brown (TRJJB112)\r\n\r\nThis issue has been troubleshooted and it was determined that a part of the system must be replaced.\r\nReplacement part has been recommended.  Complaints are monitored for trend monthly for the Product Surveillance Committee (PSC) meeting.\r\n\r\nPlease close complaint upon appropriate resolution for the customer.\r\n\r\n__________________\r\n\r\nProblem Description\r\n07.07.2025          18:13:51            John Morris (JMORRIS)\r\n\r\nIntermittent sensor connection\r\n\r\n--------INITIAL LOG-------- 07/07/2025 11:30:10 AM (Dentsply Sirona Charlotte Time)\r\n\r\nWarranty: Yes\r\nDealer on-site: Yes\r\nBillable: No\r\nBilling Accepted: n/a\r\nBilling Approved By:n/a\r\n90 Day Expiration Date: 10/05/2025\r\n\r\nRemote Access: Yes\r\nSidexis Version: none\r\n\r\nTroubleshooting Description: tested sensor with tech\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n__________________\r\n\r\nSolution Description\r\n07.07.2025          18:13:51            John Morris (JMORRIS)\r\n\r\nSolution Description: Recommeded spare cable -- provided PN 100007219\r\nReplaced current cable with replacement from kit box --\r\nTest captures = Cannot capture in Open Dental -- need to contact vendor to reconfigure sw\r\n\r\nFunctional (Yes/No): Yes\r\n\r\nS33 SN 24018825\r\n\r\n__________________\r\nNote\r\n07.07.2025          17:50:39            John Morris (JMORRIS)\r\n\r\n__ Initial ticket creation __\r\n\r\n__________________\r\n\r\n\r\nLog\r\n07.07.2025          17:50:38            John Morris (JMORRIS)",
