oubleshoot the issue on their own with current setup\r\n\r\nFunctional (Yes/No): Does NOT work on old twain setup Works fine with Sidexis and compatible sensor plug-in\r\n\r\n\r\n__________________\r\n\r\nLog\r\n07.07.2025          18:04:45            Talia Nastacio (TNASTACIO)\r\nNote\r\n07.07.2025          18:04:45            Talia Nastacio (TNASTACIO)\r\n\r\n__ Initial ticket creation __\r\n\r\n__________________",
