      "notes_text": "Note\r\n24.07.2025          17:12:47            Randall Daniels (DIYWJ409)\r\n\r\n__  Further Action __\r\n------FURTHER ACTION-------  07/24/2025 11:00:31 AM (Dentsply Sirona Charlotte Time)\r\nCaller Full Name:  Michael Sebas\r\nCaller Phone Number: 9075138208\r\nCaller Role: IT\r\n\r\nWarranty Status: Warranty\r\nBilling Previously Accepted: NA\r\nBilling Accepted: NA\r\nBilling Approved By: NA\r\n\r\nProblem Description:\r\nissue with x-rays not working, green blinking light, then blinks red, works sporadically -issue occurs in different rooms and different times\r\n\r\nTroubleshooting Description:\r\nTV connection\r\npractice has about 4 or 5 sensors\r\nUSB modules are in the OPs and they move the sensors around\r\nissue is present on all PCs with all sensors\r\nlooked thru logs- no good data\r\noffice was able to show a video.- during image capture the red circle keeps spinning and doesnt allow them to move from the screen- see screenshot of video attached\r\ncontacted\r\nPCs are small form factor Dells\r\n\r\nSolution Description:\r\nrecommended to try USB hubs per lead tech\r\nIf issue comes back please contact t Lead tech- issue has persisted for over a year with no resolution- Please Escalate\r\n\r\n\r\n__________________\r\n\r\nProblem Description\r\n07.07.2025          23:27:15            Austin Stevens (ASTEVENS)\r\n\r\nHenry called in wanting to know what the latest version of Sidexis was.\r\n__________________\r\n\r\nSolution Description\r\n07.07.2025          23:27:15            Austin Stevens (ASTEVENS)\r\n\r\nSolution Description: Told him Sidexis 4.4 which he confirmed is the version the office is currently on.\r\n\r\n\r\nFunctional (Yes/No):Yes\r\n\r\n\r\n__________________\r\n\r\nLog\r\n07.07.2025          23:27:15            Austin Stevens (ASTEVENS)\r\nNote\r\n07.07.2025          23:27:15            Austin Stevens (ASTEVENS)\r\n\r\n__ Initial ticket creation __\r\n\r\n__________________",
