      "notes_text": "Customer Note\r\n08.09.2025          15:58:21            David Balfour (DIKHU013)\r\n\r\nHello Jill,\r\n\r\nI seem to have resolved the issue, the correct software drivers were installed, but the USB device was selected instead of the Sensor:\r\n\r\n\r\nHere I have selected the sensor and the light shows green:\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nPlease test,\r\n\r\nRegards,\r\n\r\nDavid Balfour\r\nDigital Support Specialist\r\nField Sales\r\n01453 793190\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nDavid.Balfour@dentsplysirona.com\r\n\r\nwww.dentsplysirona.com\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n__________________\r\n\r\nCustomer Note\r\n04.09.2025          11:02:20             CPIC_SIMO (CPIC_SIMO)\r\n\r\nAdditional information provided by Guest User:\r\nHi David,\r\n\r\nThe surgery PC and sensor will not be free until Monday after 1. I will put a note in my diary to contact you with the details then.\r\n\r\nThanks and kind regards,\r\n\r\nJill\r\n__________________\r\n\r\nCustomer Note\r\n04.09.2025          10:44:13            David Balfour (DIKHU013)\r\n\r\nHello Jill,\r\n\r\nplease provide the Teamviewer details of the pc so that we can check the driver is the latest version,\r\n\r\nRegards,\r\n\r\nDavid Balfour\r\nDigital Support Specialist\r\nField Sales\r\n01453 793190\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nDavid.Balfour@dentsplysirona.com\r\n\r\nwww.dentsplysirona.com\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n__________________\r\n\r\nCustomer Note\r\n26.08.2025          11:42:56             CPIC_SIMO (CPIC_SIMO)\r\n\r\nAdditional information provided by Guest User:\r\nHi David, the surgery/PC is free after 2.30 today so I will get in then and send it to you.\r\n\r\nKind regards,\r\n\r\nJill\r\n__________________\r\n\r\nCustomer Note\r\n26.08.2025          10:18:21            David Balfour (DIKHU013)\r\n\r\nHello Jill,\r\n\r\nplease provide the teamviewer details of the same pc again,\r\nif the 3.2 driver is used instead of the 2.2, the web address for configuration is no longer used,\r\n\r\nRegards,\r\n\r\nDavid Balfour\r\nDigital Support Specialist\r\nField Sales\r\n01453 793190\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nDavid.Balfour@dentsplysirona.com\r\n\r\nwww.dentsplysirona.com\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n__________________\r\n\r\nNote\r\n20.08.2025          13:59:36            Stefan Eisenhauer (STEEIS)\r\n\r\nFeedback From R&D:\r\nWhich IOSS version is being used 2.2 or 3.2?\r\n\r\n\r\nSidexis 4.4 is compatible with both, but only 2.2 has the configuration page at http://localhost:43808/web/configuration/#/home\r\n\r\n\r\nIOSS 3.2 no longer has a configuration page but a configuration app that is installed with it.\r\n\r\nYou can find a shortcut in the start menu as Intraoral Sensor Software/Intraoral Sensor Configuration App\r\n__________________\r\n\r\nNote\r\n20.08.2025          13:17:48            Jen Brown (TRJJB112)\r\n\r\nForwarding R&D notes to TCS.\r\n__________________\r\n\r\nNote\r\n19.08.2025          15:17:16            Andreas Bichert (DIEGC362)\r\n\r\nWhich IOSS version is being used 2.2 or 3.2?\r\n\r\n\r\nSidexis 4.4 is compatible with both, but only 2.2 has the configuration page at http://localhost:43808/web/configuration/#/home\r\n\r\n\r\nIOSS 3.2 no longer has a configuration page but a configuration app that is installed with it.\r\n\r\nYou can find a shortcut in the start menu as Intraoral Sensor Software/Intraoral Sensor Configuration App\r\n__________________\r\n\r\nNote\r\n18.08.2025          16:08:20            Stefan Eisenhauer (STEEIS)\r\n\r\nSee Feedback\r\n__________________\r\n\r\nNote\r\n18.08.2025          14:43:41            David Balfour (DIKHU013)\r\n\r\nThe issue the customer has is that they cannot activate the sensor from this web address:http://localhost:43808/web/configuration/#/home\r\nwhich is required to get the green light when taking an xray. Customer is asking is there another area they need to allow as they state they have allowed this web address and still get a blank page?\r\n\r\n__________________\r\n\r\nNote\r\n15.08.2025          15:42:11            Jen Brown (TRJJB112)\r\n\r\nHello,\r\n\r\nPlease advise what you need quality to do.  This seems like a technical question the UK is asking.  If we are not able to answer the question from the UK, does the ticket need to be sent to R&D? Please advise what help you need.\r\n\r\nThanks,\r\nJen\r\n__________________\r\n\r\nNote\r\n15.08.2025          13:00:07            Stefan Eisenhauer (STEEIS)\r\n\r\nPlease note question from David from UK Support\r\n__________________\r\n\r\nNote\r\n13.08.2025          10:58:05            David Balfour (DIKHU013)\r\n\r\nplease advise what i can tell the customer.\r\n__________________\r\n\r\nNote\r\n12.08.2025          16:00:03            Stefan Eisenhauer (STEEIS)\r\n\r\nFeedback from IO Quality Officer Jen brown:\r\nReturning to TCS-DE to forward to TCS-UK as i do not have an option to choose that team for this ticket.  Thank you!\r\n__________________\r\n\r\nNote\r\n12.08.2025          14:02:31            Jen Brown (TRJJB112)\r\n\r\nReturning to TCS-DE to forward to TCS-UK as i do not have an option to choose that team for this ticket.  Thank you!\r\n__________________\r\n\r\nNote\r\n12.08.2025          09:03:10            Stefan Eisenhauer (STEEIS)\r\n\r\nSee feedback.\r\n__________________\r\n\r\nNote\r\n04.08.2025          16:30:20            David Balfour (DIKHU013)\r\n\r\nplease advise what software allows the link http://localhost:43808/web/configuration/#/home to process as IT are asking because they cannot get the webpage to show and the sensor is showing flashing red instead of green.\r\n__________________\r\n\r\n\r\nSolution Description\r\n09.07.2025          17:16:34            David Balfour (DIKHU013)\r\n\r\nPlease refer to customer communication via Customer Notes\r\n__________________\r\nNote\r\n09.07.2025          16:38:45            Jen Brown (TRJJB112)\r\n\r\nThis issue has been troubleshooted and was determined to be related to software or connectivity related within the office and is considered routine servicing.  These requests are monitored for trend monthly at the Product Surveillance Committee (PSC) meeting.\r\n\r\nPlease close ticket.\r\n\r\n__________________\r\n\r\nCustomer Note\r\n08.07.2025          15:35:24            David Balfour (DIKHU013)\r\n\r\nHello Jill,\r\n\r\nSidexis 4.4 has been installed,\r\n\r\nYou will also need to allow this web page to allow the sensor to be registered and allow the software to access the sensor:\r\n\r\nhttp://localhost:43808/web/configuration/#/home\r\n\r\n\r\nRegards,\r\n\r\nDavid Balfour\r\nDigital Support Specialist\r\nField Sales\r\n01453 793190\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nDavid.Balfour@dentsplysirona.com\r\n\r\nwww.dentsplysirona.com\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n__________________\r\n\r\nNote\r\n08.07.2025          15:10:58            David Balfour (DIKHU013)\r\n\r\nAdmin username and password for when you need it.\r\n\r\n.\\rescue           L9JuVche7WNtMEqU\r\n\r\n__________________\r\n\r\n\r\nLog\r\n08.07.2025          13:45:24            David Balfour (DIKHU013)\r\nProblem Description\r\n08.07.2025          13:45:24            David Balfour (DIKHU013)\r\n\r\ninstall sidexis 4.4 on 1 pc to test XIOS XG sensor.\r\n__________________\r\nCustomer Note\r\n08.07.2025          13:45:24            David Balfour (DIKHU013)\r\n\r\nHello Jill,\r\n\r\ni was unable to install the Sidexis 4.4 software as i was not logged in as admin,\r\nplease advise when you have access via this login and callback on 01453 793190,\r\n\r\nRegards,\r\n\r\nDavid Balfour\r\nDigital Support Specialist\r\nField Sales\r\n01453 793190\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nDavid.Balfour@dentsplysirona.com\r\n\r\nwww.dentsplysirona.com\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n__________________",
