      "solution_summary": "Connected to workstation and checked s/w and plug-in compatibility she stated these same sensors work in other rooms but it seems to only be this room, this sensor is assigned to the room the sensor is currently recognized in AE utility tool found that the SUI on USB needs to be updated removed the sensor and updated firmware reconnected but having issues with Twain recognizing the sensor tested with Twain Test and it shows no sensor detected as well device manager and AE utility still show sensor recognized had her check if repair kit screwdriver is available and may have her clean contacts while I updated prerequisites .NET and MSXML were missing no cable kit to clean contacts -- rebooted PC allowed her to take multiple exposures, since she stated the issue is only with series exposures -- she took multiple in series without issues she tested with another sensor to to confirm they also work Functional (Yes/No): Yes __________________ Log 08.07.2025 20:57:36 Talia Nastacio (TNASTACIO) Note 08.07.2025 20:57:36 Talia Nastacio (TNASTACIO) __ Initial ticket creation __ __________________"
