      "notes_text": "Note\r\n09.07.2025          17:01:07            Jen Brown (TRJJB112)\r\n\r\nThis issue has been troubleshooted and was determined to be related to software or connectivity related within the office and is considered routine servicing.  These requests are monitored for trend monthly at the Product Surveillance Committee (PSC) meeting.\r\n\r\nPlease close ticket.\r\n\r\n__________________\r\n\r\nProblem Description\r\n08.07.2025          21:47:36            Austin Stevens (ASTEVENS)\r\n\r\n--------INITIAL LOG-------- 07/08/2025 3:40:13 PM (Dentsply Sirona Charlotte Time)\r\n\r\nWarranty: No\r\nDealer on-site: No\r\nBillable: Yes\r\nBilling Accepted: Previous Ticket: 1228743\r\nBilling Approved By:  Debbie Cowan\r\n90 Day Expiration Date: 10/06/2025\r\n\r\nRemote Access: Yes\r\nSidexis Version: Sidexis 4.3.1\r\nServer Location:  WCD-FILE-01\r\nPDATA Remote Location: WCD-FILE-01\r\nRCU Location (If Applicable): NA\r\nPractice Management: Dentrix\r\nWorkstation(s): WS-000447, WS-000555\r\nScout Check: No\r\n\r\n\r\nTroubleshooting Description: Keagan called in because theres three PCs they cannot see their Schick sensor on.\r\nRemoted into WS-000443, WS000447, WS000555 and see a high uptime (more than 15 days).\r\nSchick sensor not showing in sensor configuration page.\r\nRestarted Sirona Intraoral Service and sensor is showing in Sidexis now.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n__________________\r\n\r\nSolution Description\r\n08.07.2025          21:47:36            Austin Stevens (ASTEVENS)\r\n\r\nSolution Description: Restarted Sirona Intraoral Service + reseated sensor.\r\n\r\n\r\nFunctional (Yes/No): Yes\r\n\r\n\r\n__________________\r\n\r\nLog\r\n08.07.2025          21:39:32            Austin Stevens (ASTEVENS)\r\nNote\r\n08.07.2025          21:39:32            Austin Stevens (ASTEVENS)\r\n\r\n__ Initial ticket creation __\r\n\r\n__________________",
