      "notes_text": "Note\r\n09.07.2025          17:04:25            Jen Brown (TRJJB112)\r\n\r\nThis issue has been troubleshooted and it was determined that a part of the system must be replaced.\r\nReplacement part has been recommended.  Complaints are monitored for trend monthly for the Product Surveillance Committee (PSC) meeting.\r\n\r\nPlease close complaint upon appropriate resolution for the customer.\r\n\r\n__________________\r\n\r\nProblem Description\r\n08.07.2025          22:30:03            Austin Stevens (ASTEVENS)\r\n\r\n--------INITIAL LOG-------- 07/08/2025 4:26:59 PM (Dentsply Sirona Charlotte Time)\r\n\r\nWarranty:\r\nDealer on-site:\r\nBillable: No\r\n\r\nDetails: Cameron called in requesting information on a sensor they were troubleshooting with Henry Schein.\r\nHe explained the sensor attached is not being recognized in any room.\r\nTheyve gone through the troubleshooting with Schein who had them replace the elastomeric strip, the sensor cable, the USB cable to the USB interface all with no success.\r\n- -\r\nCameron also states the office used a known working USB interface with this sensor and it still didnt work.\r\nThis only leaves the sensor as being the culprit.\r\n\r\n__________________\r\n\r\nSolution Description\r\n08.07.2025          22:30:03            Austin Stevens (ASTEVENS)\r\n\r\nSolution Description: Reaching out to PTC for a date of purchase for the attached sensor.\r\nSchick portal says ship date of 2021, however I will confirm purchase date and email Cameron with this information.\r\n- -\r\nRecommendation is going to be a new sensor given previous troubleshooting steps.\r\n\r\nFunctional (Yes/No): No\r\n\r\n\r\n__________________\r\n\r\nLog\r\n08.07.2025          22:23:47            Austin Stevens (ASTEVENS)\r\nNote\r\n08.07.2025          22:23:47            Austin Stevens (ASTEVENS)\r\n\r\n__ Initial ticket creation __\r\n\r\n__________________",
