      "notes_text": "Note\r\n10.07.2025          14:26:27            Jen Brown (TRJJB112)\r\n\r\nThis issue has been troubleshooted and was determined to be related to software or connectivity related within the office and is considered routine servicing.  These requests are monitored for trend monthly at the Product Surveillance Committee (PSC) meeting.\r\n\r\nPlease close ticket.\r\n\r\n__________________\r\n\r\nProblem Description\r\n09.07.2025          21:37:55            Jean Lagraba (DIUQY284)\r\n\r\n--------INITIAL LOG-------- 07/09/2025 1:56:13 PM (Dentsply Sirona Charlotte Time)\r\n\r\nWarranty: YES\r\nDealer on-site: no\r\nBillable:\r\nBilling Accepted:\r\nBilling Approved By:\r\n90 Day Expiration Date: 10/07/2025\r\n\r\nRemote Access:\r\nSidexis Version:  4.4\r\nServer Location:  \\\\serverw10\r\nPDATA Remote Location:  \\\\Bp-data\\pdata\r\nRCU Location (If Applicable):\r\nPractice Management:\r\nWorkstation(s): Bp-OP4\r\nScout Check:\r\n\r\nFirmware:\r\nPlug-in Version:\r\nExposure Count:\r\nUnit IP Address:\r\n\r\nTroubleshooting Details:  Sensors not being detected often in sidexis. They have 3 sensors and they swap these thru rooms.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n__________________\r\n\r\nSolution Description\r\n09.07.2025          21:37:55            Jean Lagraba (DIUQY284)\r\n\r\nSolution Description:\r\n\r\ntried to see what was causing the sensors and or usb modules not to display in the config software. i noticed it could be core isolation effecting the way the plugin software connects the sensor. i disabled Core isolation, removed the software and rebooted 5 woprkstations and repeated the installation for the sensor software. Issue seemed to go away although this may be a temp fix but they seem to be happier with the sensors being seen faster and more successfull\r\n\r\n\r\nFunctional Test Successful / Follow Up:\r\n__________________\r\n\r\nLog\r\n09.07.2025          19:55:19            Jean Lagraba (DIUQY284)\r\nNote\r\n09.07.2025          19:55:19            Jean Lagraba (DIUQY284)\r\n\r\n__ Initial ticket creation __\r\n\r\n__________________",
