      "notes_text": "Customer Note\r\n25.08.2025          11:57:53             CPIC_SIMO (CPIC_SIMO)\r\n\r\nGrazie, confermo merce arrivata. Siamo a posto cosi.\r\n\r\n__________________\r\n\r\nNote\r\n25.08.2025          10:35:04            Giulio Risi (GIURIS)\r\n\r\nPackage shipped to: Dentsply Sirona , York PA, 1301 Smile Way (ATTENTION: JEN BROWN)\r\nUPS tracking number 1Z8W6F386699283072\r\n__________________\r\n\r\nCustomer Note\r\n25.08.2025          10:24:27            Giulio Risi (GIURIS)\r\n\r\nCi risulta consegnato oggi alle 10:01, tracking UPS 1ZX5A1210400375632.\r\n__________________\r\n\r\nCustomer Note\r\n25.08.2025          10:13:08             CPIC_SIMO (CPIC_SIMO)\r\n\r\nBuongiorno, le 4 protezioni sono state consegnate a fine Luglio alla vs sede di VR, ci sono notizie per i pezzi in sostituzione?\r\ngrazie\r\n__________________\r\n\r\nNote\r\n19.08.2025          04:18:08             UC4BATCH (UC4BATCH)\r\n\r\nNo response from customer, request automatically closed.\r\n__________________\r\n\r\n\r\nSolution Description\r\n19.08.2025          04:18:05             UC4BATCH (UC4BATCH)\r\n\r\nPlease refer to customer communication via Customer Notes\r\n__________________\r\nNote\r\n04.08.2025          20:53:40            Jen Brown (TRJJB112)\r\n\r\nWe are a distributor only for this product, therefore the manufacturer is responsible for all post market, regulatory reporting, and corrective action activities.\r\n\r\nThe complaint information has been provided to the manufacturer to investigate and take any action.\r\n\r\nComplaints are monitored for trend monthly for the Product Surveillance Committee (PSC) meeting.\r\n\r\nPlease close complaint upon appropriate resolution for the customer.\r\n\r\n__________________\r\n\r\nNote\r\n30.07.2025          10:11:18            Giulio Risi (GIURIS)\r\n\r\nIn attesa del reso da Revello dei 4 pezzi sospetti.\r\n__________________\r\n\r\nCustomer Note\r\n30.07.2025          10:07:05            Alessio De Luca (DIHDL129)\r\n\r\nBuongiorno,\r\nordine in garanzia inserito.\r\n\r\nPRATICA:SO0931935\r\n\r\n\r\nPO: 00690727\r\n\r\n\r\nCordiali saluti\r\nAlessio\r\n__________________\r\n\r\nNote\r\n30.07.2025          09:19:21            Giulio Risi (GIURIS)\r\n\r\nInviare in garanzia al dealer (Revello Verona) 4 pezzi del seguente codice:\r\n6176569 XIOS Hygienic Covers size 2 (300 p)\r\n\r\nSpecificare nella spedizione allattenzione di Federico Mazzola.\r\n\r\nPoi riassegnare il ticket a me, grazie.\r\n__________________\r\n\r\nNote\r\n30.07.2025          07:45:53            Thomas Waldraff (DIGSJ847)\r\n\r\nplease note the message from jen Brown.\r\n__________________\r\n\r\nNote\r\n29.07.2025          16:20:35            Jen Brown (TRJJB112)\r\n\r\nBased on the information provided in the ticket, this appears to be a fit issue of the received sheaths (customer ordered size 2 and received boxes labeled size 2).  It cannot be confirmed at this time to be mislabeled product as the customer received the product labeled as what they ordered.\r\n\r\nPlease return the product immediately to York,PA Smile Way (responsible manufacturer) to investigate the issue further.\r\n\r\nPlease send to ATTENTION:  JEN BROWN to ensure a timely investigation.\r\n\r\nForwarding back to TCS-DE to return to Italy team.\r\n__________________\r\n\r\nNote\r\n29.07.2025          14:56:26            Klaus Schrick (KLAUSC)\r\n\r\nHi Jen,\r\n\r\nwould you like to take over this task, and feedback, if you would like to request the hardware shipped to whom ?\r\n\r\nthen please answer within the note and foreward back to processing team:\r\n\r\nKSC USA/.....\r\n__________________\r\n\r\nNote\r\n29.07.2025          12:30:07            Jessica Peters (DIGEX067)\r\n\r\nHallo zusammen,\r\n\r\nbitte um Info ob ihr die Ware haben und untersuchen wollt.\r\n\r\nViele Grüße\r\nJessica\r\n\r\n__________________\r\n\r\nCustomer Note\r\n28.07.2025          09:13:04             CPIC_SIMO (CPIC_SIMO)\r\n\r\nBuongiorno, non ho più ricevuto notizie dopo la telefonata con il sig. Giulio. Eravamo restati che richiedeva la possibilità di un  reso per accredito o una sostituzione. Ci sono novità in merito?\r\ngrazie 1000\r\n__________________\r\n\r\nNote\r\n24.07.2025          12:54:20            Klaus Schrick (KLAUSC)\r\n\r\nkönnt ihr eine falschbestellung erkennen, oder hat der kunde etwas falsches bekommen?\r\nbitte um bearbeitung\r\n__________________\r\n\r\nNote\r\n24.07.2025          12:14:20            Thomas Waldraff (DIGSJ847)\r\n\r\nHallo Klaus,\r\n\r\nKannst du das bitte an die zuständige stelle geben.\r\n\r\nGruß Thomas\r\n__________________\r\n\r\nNote\r\n14.07.2025          16:56:08            Giulio Risi (GIURIS)\r\n\r\nOur dealer purchased 5 packs of code 6176569 with the enclosed delivery note.\r\nThe customer opened one pack and told us it contained size 1 instead of size 2.\r\nHe kept the pack but wants to return the other 4 and replace them under warranty.\r\nCan we do that?\r\nWould you like to check the batch to make sure no other packs with the same problem have been sent to other customers?\r\n\r\nThanks.\r\n__________________\r\n\r\nCustomer Note\r\n14.07.2025          08:54:18             CPIC_SIMO (CPIC_SIMO)\r\n\r\nBuongiorno, qualche novità in merito?\r\n\r\n__________________\r\n\r\nNote\r\n11.07.2025          09:13:59             UC4BATCH (UC4BATCH)\r\nNew Attachment IMG_2024-08-27_16-13-00.jpg was added!New Attachment  was added!New Attachment ddt.pdf was added!\r\n__________________\r\n\r\nNote\r\n11.07.2025          09:13:58             UC4BATCH (UC4BATCH)\r\nNew Attachment IMG_2024-08-27_16-13-00.jpg was added!New Attachment  was added!New Attachment ddt.pdf was added!\r\n__________________\r\n\r\nNote\r\n11.07.2025          09:13:58             UC4BATCH (UC4BATCH)\r\nNew Attachment IMG_2024-08-27_16-13-00.jpg was added!New Attachment  was added!New Attachment ddt.pdf was added!\r\n__________________\r\n\r\nCustomer Note\r\n11.07.2025          09:13:18     