      "notes_text": "Note\r\n11.07.2025          14:21:57            Jen Brown (TRJJB112)\r\n\r\nThis issue has been troubleshooted and it was determined that a part of the system must be replaced.\r\nReplacement part has been recommended.  Complaints are monitored for trend monthly for the Product Surveillance Committee (PSC) meeting.\r\n\r\nPlease close complaint upon appropriate resolution for the customer.\r\n\r\n__________________\r\n\r\nNote\r\n10.07.2025          16:46:19             UC4BATCH (UC4BATCH)\r\nNew Attachment IMG_2024-08-27_16-13-00.jpg was added!New Attachment  was added!New Attachment IMG_1043.jpeg was added!New Attachment IMG_1044.jpeg was added!\r\n__________________\r\n\r\nNote\r\n10.07.2025          16:46:19             UC4BATCH (UC4BATCH)\r\nNew Attachment IMG_2024-08-27_16-13-00.jpg was added!New Attachment  was added!New Attachment IMG_1043.jpeg was added!New Attachment IMG_1044.jpeg was added!\r\n__________________\r\n\r\nNote\r\n10.07.2025          16:46:18             UC4BATCH (UC4BATCH)\r\nNew Attachment IMG_2024-08-27_16-13-00.jpg was added!New Attachment  was added!New Attachment IMG_1043.jpeg was added!New Attachment IMG_1044.jpeg was added!\r\n__________________\r\n\r\nNote\r\n10.07.2025          16:46:17             UC4BATCH (UC4BATCH)\r\nNew Attachment IMG_2024-08-27_16-13-00.jpg was added!New Attachment  was added!New Attachment IMG_1043.jpeg was added!New Attachment IMG_1044.jpeg was added!\r\n__________________\r\n\r\n\r\nSolution Description\r\n10.07.2025          16:44:58            Rebecca Buck (RBUCK)\r\n\r\nInterface orange is W11\r\nBroken by not using wire clips and using wrong USB cable.\r\n\r\nCDR Dicom and old driver on W11.\r\n__________________\r\nProblem Description\r\n10.07.2025          16:43:24            Rebecca Buck (RBUCK)\r\n\r\nInterface orange is W11\r\n\r\n````--------INITIAL LOG-------- 07/10/2025 9:21:36 AM (Dentsply Sirona Charlotte Time)\r\n\r\nWarranty:Unknown\r\nDealer on-site:Yes\r\nBillable: no\r\n\r\nRemote Access:\r\nSidexis Version:None CDR DICOM installed 3/3/2023\r\nServer Location:DESKTOP-54J3I0P\r\nPDATA Remote Location:\r\nRCU Location (If Applicable):\r\nPractice Management:\r\nWorkstation(s):DESKTOP-54J3I0P\r\nScout Check:\r\n\r\nFirmware:\r\nPlug-in Version:1.1 to 3.2\r\n\r\nTroubleshooting Details:\r\nDid session on XRAY Dell_Dr. Cortes.\r\nDESKTOP-54J3I0P\r\nLaptop stand alone of CDR Server and capture.\r\nW11 on laptop with wireless in public.\r\nChanged to private.\r\nHad him turn off power management on USB ports.\r\nWire clips missing.\r\nThey are using a wrong USB wire and dont know where original is.\r\n\r\nExplained W11 does not run CDR.\r\nGave them folder on desktop for IT with website and upgrade procedure.\r\n\r\nUsed tech Toolbox to install missing C++ and installed 3.2 after removing 1.1.\r\nRebooted and driver is present.\r\n\r\nInterface not showing.\r\nNeeds replaced.\r\nHe will work with office and call to adjust the ticket to Patterson if warranty is still in effect.\r\nBroken by not using wire clips and using wrong USB cable.\r\nParts to replace:\r\nUSB 3.0 interface: 100008290\r\n\r\nFunctional Test Successful / Follow Up:\r\nLeft note for IT in folder:\r\n\r\nCDR is not supported.\r\nNeed server in W10 or SERVER 2016 to run to pull up old and transfer.\r\nSidexis replaces it. See docs in folder and Tech notices on this website.\r\n\r\nhttps://www.dentsplysironasupport.com/en-us/user_section/user_section_imaging/schick_brand_software.html\r\n\r\nPart number for Sidexis and wire clips provided for free.\r\nIT support will be charged at $250 to assist in upgrade if sensor is not in warranty.\r\n\r\nUSB Interface not working.\r\nWarranty unknown.\r\nNeed PO for sensor # 18001434 from Patterson to determine Warranty.\r\n\r\nBroken by not using wire clips and using wrong USB cable.\r\nParts to replace:\r\nUSB 3.0 interface: 100008290\r\n\r\nNo warranty on USB wire: 100007971\r\n\r\n\r\n__________________\r\n\r\nLog\r\n10.07.2025          15:22:04            Rebecca Buck (RBUCK)\r\nNote\r\n10.07.2025          15:22:04            Rebecca Buck (RBUCK)\r\n\r\n__ Initial ticket creation __\r\n\r\n__________________",
