      "problem_description": "Interface orange is W11 ````--------INITIAL LOG-------- 07/10/2025 9:21:36 AM (Dentsply Sirona Charlotte Time) Warranty:Unknown Dealer on-site:Yes Billable: no Remote Access: Sidexis Version:None CDR DICOM installed 3/3/2023 Server Location:DESKTOP-54J3I0P PDATA Remote Location: RCU Location (If Applicable): Practice Management: Workstation(s):DESKTOP-54J3I0P Scout Check: Firmware: Plug-in Version:1.1 to 3.2 Troubleshooting Details: Did session on XRAY Dell_Dr. Cortes. DESKTOP-54J3I0P Laptop stand alone of CDR Server and capture. W11 on laptop with wireless in public. Changed to private. Had him turn off power management on USB ports. Wire clips missing. They are using a wrong USB wire and dont know where original is. Explained W11 does not run CDR. Gave them folder on desktop for IT with website and upgrade procedure. Used tech Toolbox to install missing C++ and installed 3.2 after removing 1.1. Rebooted and driver is present. Interface not showing. Needs replaced. He will work with office and call to adjust the ticket to Patterson if warranty is still in effect. Broken by not using wire clips and using wrong USB cable. Parts to replace: USB 3.0 interface: 100008290 Functional Test Successful / Follow Up: Left note for IT in folder: CDR is not supported. Need server in W10 or SERVER 2016 to run to pull up old and transfer. Sidexis replaces it. See docs in folder and Tech notices on this website. https://www.dentsplysironasupport.com/en-us/user_section/user_section_imaging/schick_brand_software.html Part number for Sidexis and wire clips provided for free. IT support will be charged at $250 to assist in upgrade if sensor is not in warranty. USB Interface not working. Warranty unknown. Need PO for sensor # 18001434 from Patterson to determine Warranty. Broken by not using wire clips and using wrong USB cable. Parts to replace: USB 3.0 interface: 100008290 No warranty on USB wire: 100007971 Log Note __ Initial ticket creation __",
