      "notes_text": "Note\r\n11.07.2025          15:12:44            Jen Brown (TRJJB112)\r\n\r\nThis issue has been troubleshooted and was determined to be related to software or connectivity related within the office and is considered routine servicing.  These requests are monitored for trend monthly at the Product Surveillance Committee (PSC) meeting.\r\n\r\nPlease close ticket.\r\n\r\n__________________\r\n\r\n\r\nSolution Description\r\n10.07.2025          19:25:07            Elhadji Seye (SELHADJI)\r\n\r\n``--------INITIAL LOG-------- 07/10/2025 1:22:29 PM (Dentsply Sirona Charlotte Time)\r\n\r\nWarranty: Yes\r\nDealer on-site: No\r\nBillable: No\r\nBilling Accepted:\r\nBilling Approved By:\r\n90 Day Expiration Date: 10/08/2025\r\n\r\nRemote Access: TV\r\nSidexis Version:\r\nServer Location:\r\nPDATA Remote Location:\r\nRCU Location (If Applicable):\r\nPractice Management:\r\nWorkstation(s): 2469mg09\r\nScout Check:\r\n\r\nFirmware:\r\nPlug-in Version:\r\nExposure Count:\r\nUnit IP Address:\r\n\r\nTroubleshooting Details: Office uses Cdr Twain in Dexis. I told tech that this setup is not no longer supported. We now use the Sitwain. Office did not have Sidexis installed. I helped him fix the issue by running the Patch in Cdr 5.16. Now he can take Xray.\r\n\r\nFunctional Test Successful / Follow Up:\r\n2469mg09\r\n__________________\r\nProblem Description\r\n10.07.2025          19:22:21            Elhadji Seye (SELHADJI)\r\n\r\nHe said that the image wont load, and he found an error with the ImageProcess.dll in Event Viewer.\r\n__________________\r\n\r\nLog\r\n10.07.2025          19:20:36            Elhadji Seye (SELHADJI)\r\nNote\r\n10.07.2025          19:20:36            Elhadji Seye (SELHADJI)\r\n\r\n__ Initial ticket creation __\r\n\r\n__________________",
