      "notes_text": "Note\r\n11.07.2025          14:12:15            Jen Brown (TRJJB112)\r\n\r\nThis issue has been troubleshooted and was determined to be related to software or connectivity related within the office and is considered routine servicing.  These requests are monitored for trend monthly at the Product Surveillance Committee (PSC) meeting.\r\n\r\nPlease close ticket.\r\n\r\n__________________\r\n\r\nNote\r\n10.07.2025          21:44:29            Austin Stevens (ASTEVENS)\r\n\r\n__  Further Action __\r\n------FURTHER ACTION-------  07/10/2025 3:41:13 PM (Dentsply Sirona Charlotte Time)\r\n\r\nCallers Full Name: Regina Green\r\nCallers Phone Number: 7273673313\r\nCallers Role: Office staff\r\n\r\nWarranty Status: Schick Club (invoice attached to ticket: 1193542)\r\nBilling Previously Accepted: NA\r\n\r\nProblem Description: Regina called because they took x-rays directly in Dentrixs local acquisition agent.\r\nThis put the patient in Sidexis with the incorrect information.\r\n\r\nTroubleshooting Description: Since this is not being bridged from the Dentrix Practice Management System and instead being created from the acquisition agent theres not a way to change the patient information from the end user side.\r\n\r\nSolution Description: Logged into their server and changed the IsCardIDExternal = 0 for the affected patient.\r\nShe can now edit / delete that patient.\r\n- -\r\nRegina has told the staff not to take x-rays in Dentrix, and will re-iterate this again.\r\n\r\nFunctional (Yes/No): Yes\r\n\r\n__________________\r\n\r\n\r\nSolution Description\r\n10.07.2025          21:01:21            Nehalkumar Shah (DIMVQ960)\r\n\r\nSolution Description:\r\nNot trained on Sensor. Transferred the call.\r\n\r\nFunctional (Yes/No): No\r\n\r\n\r\n__________________\r\nNote\r\n10.07.2025          20:59:08            Nehalkumar Shah (DIMVQ960)\r\n\r\n__ Initial ticket creation __\r\n\r\n__________________\r\n\r\nProblem Description\r\n10.07.2025          20:59:07  