    {
      "ticket_id": "8001259320",
      "created_at": "2025-07-10",
      "record_type_group": "COMPLAINT",
      "region": "US",
      "language": "en",
      "category_level_2": "Schick 33 with AE USB",
      "category_level_3": "Electronics",
      "category_level_4": "Intermittent Operation / Connectivity",
      "firmware": "",
      "support_hub": "US",
      "description_text": "on-going schick connectivity issues",
      "notes_text": "Customer Note\r\n23.07.2025          00:18:38             CPIC_SIMO (CPIC_SIMO)\r\n\r\nthere hasnt been a solution provided.\r\n__________________\r\n\r\nNote\r\n22.07.2025          19:37:53            Jen Brown (TRJJB112)\r\n\r\nForwarding R&D response to TCS.\r\n__________________\r\n\r\nNote\r\n22.07.2025          12:18:06            Andreas Bichert (DIEGC362)\r\n\r\nThe data provided is insufficient to analyze the problem.\r\n\r\nThe only thing you can see from the IO-Log is that the Sidexis server is not configured yet. This can be done in the Conig App from IOSS.\r\n\r\nTo analyze the connection problems, we need the logs from the Sidexis server and event logs.\r\n__________________\r\n\r\nNote\r\n22.07.2025          12:16:22            Andreas Bichert (DIEGC362)\r\n\r\nDie zu Verfügung bereitgestellte Daten sind unzureichend um eine Analyse des Problems zu machen.\r\n\r\nDas Einzige was man erkennt aus dem IO-Lo, dass der Sidexis Server nicht konfiguriert ist. Das kann man im Conig App von IOSS machen.\r\n\r\nFür die Analyse der Verbindungsproblemen brauchen wir die Logs von Sidexis Server und Events-Logs.\r\n__________________\r\n\r\nNote\r\n16.07.2025          09:56:56            Andreas Bichert (DIEGC362)\r\n\r\nIm Bearbeitung\r\n__________________\r\n\r\nNote\r\n11.07.2025          15:34:56            Jen Brown (TRJJB112)\r\n\r\nForwarding logs to R&D as requested\r\n__________________\r\n\r\n\r\nSolution Description\r\n10.07.2025          22:55:44            Austin Stevens (ASTEVENS)\r\n\r\nSolution Description: Requesting logs be evaluated by R&D further.\r\nLogs uploaded to attachments.\r\n\r\n*** Could not select unknown further investigation required it would not allow me to save ticket ***\r\n\r\nFunctional (Yes/No): Yes (intermittently)\r\n\r\n\r\n__________________\r\nProblem Description\r\n10.07.2025          22:55:04            Austin Stevens (ASTEVENS)\r\n\r\n--------INITIAL LOG-------- 07/10/2025 4:44:47 PM (Dentsply Sirona Charlotte Time)\r\n\r\nWarranty: Yes\r\nDealer on-site: Yes\r\nBillable: No (Canada)\r\nBilling Accepted:  NA\r\nBilling Approved By:  NA\r\n90 Day Expiration Date: 10/08/2025\r\n\r\nRemote Access: Yes\r\nPractice Management: Safecom\r\n\r\nTroubleshooting Description: Remoted into SELK-DELL, and WS15-C.\r\nEvery PC in the office has been having long standing intermittent connectivity issues with their sensors.\r\nAll of our previous suggestions to the practice have been unsuccessful.\r\n- -\r\nThe office has done the following:\r\nUsing powered USB hubs.\r\nRemoved Sentinel One anti-virus.\r\nUsed a full sized tower (PC) vs the micro style they have now.\r\nDisabled USB power management settings.\r\n- -\r\nA common fix for the office is to restart the PC, or for one of our remote technicians to restart the Sirona Intraoral Service.\r\nAnother Henry Schein technician in the past - Ted Kaltani - installed the legacy drivers on one PC and it worked for the entirety of the time they were installed on there.\r\nWhen IOSS v3.2 was re-installed (after removing the legacy driver) it started having intermittent connectivity again.\r\n- -\r\nThe issue was unable to be replicated while I was remoted in and Stephen was on site.\r\n- -\r\nLogs for two PCs have been uploaded to attachments.\r\nEvery PC in the office is having an issue.\r\nSeveral practices having issues since upgrading to IOSS plug-in after the legacy drivers.\r\nRequesting these logs be looked at by R&D for further investigation.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n__________________\r\n\r\nLog\r\n10.07.2025          22:44:30            Austin Stevens (ASTEVENS)\r\nNote\r\n10.07.2025          22:44:30            Austin Stevens (ASTEVENS)\r\n\r\n__ Initial ticket creation __\r\n\r\n__________________",
      "excel_matched": true,
      "desc_primary_raw": "Connectivity/Recognition",
      "desc_secondary_raw": "Sensor Detection Failure (Intermittent)",
      "primary": "Connectivity/Recognition",
      "secondary": "Sensor Detection Failure (Intermittent)",
      "clarity": "clear",
      "tickets": 1,
      "classification_source": "ollama",
