      "support_hub": "US",
      "description_text": "schick sensor not working",
      "notes_text": "Note\r\n11.07.2025          15:27:00            Jen Brown (TRJJB112)\r\n\r\nThis issue has been troubleshooted and it was determined that a part of the system must be replaced.\r\nReplacement part has been recommended.  Complaints are monitored for trend monthly for the Product Surveillance Committee (PSC) meeting.\r\n\r\nPlease close complaint upon appropriate resolution for the customer.\r\n\r\n__________________\r\n\r\nProblem Description\r\n11.07.2025          00:10:16            Sebastian Cedeno (SCEDENO)\r\n\r\nCaller states 2 sensors dont work on any room, there other 2 work fine.\r\n\r\n--------INITIAL LOG-------- 07/10/2025 5:35:10 PM (Dentsply Sirona Charlotte Time)\r\n\r\nWarranty: yes\r\nDealer on-site: no\r\nBillable: no\r\nBilling Accepted:na\r\nBilling Approved By:na\r\n90 Day Expiration Date: 10/08/2025\r\n\r\nRemote Access: yes\r\nSidexis Version: na\r\nServer Location:na\r\nPDATA Remote Location: na\r\nRCU Location (If Applicable): na\r\nPractice Management: Eaglesoft\r\nWorkstation(s): OPERATORY04\r\nScout Check: yes\r\n\r\nFirmware: 1.4.107\r\nPlug-in Version: CDR 1.1\r\nExposure Count: na\r\nUnit IP Address: na\r\n\r\nTroubleshooting Description: remoted into OPERATORY04, checked software installed, CDR 1.1 and Schick Elite 5.16.\r\nCurrent sensor cable SN is XS33220.\r\nTook an exposure in 0.32 65 kv .25ma with Vatech DGS0101V1, no response. (showing green in CDR twain)\r\nI had caller use a good known sensor she connected a Schick Elite sensor and 2.0 interface, this one worked after a couple of tries.\r\nConnected the 3.0 and the Schick 33 sensor, PC light is on, sensor light is off (although is connected)\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n__________________\r\n\r\nSolution Description\r\n11.07.2025          00:09:22            Sebastian Cedeno (SCEDENO)\r\n\r\nSolution Description: provided video to replace the sensor cable, she will try to find the box it came in, if that does not work then the sensor will need to be replaced.\r\n\r\n\r\nFunctional (Yes/No): No.\r\n\r\n\r\n__________________\r\nNote\r\n10.07.2025          23:35:39            Sebastian Cedeno (SCEDENO)\r\n\r\n__ Initial ticket creation __\r\n\r\n__________________\r\n\r\n\r\nLog\r\n10.07.2025          23:35:38            Sebastian Cedeno (SCEDENO)",
