      "problem_summary": "remoted into OPERATORY04, checked software installed, CDR 1.1 and Schick Elite 5.16. Current sensor cable SN is XS33220. Took an exposure in 0.32 65 kv .25ma with Vatech DGS0101V1, no response. (showing green in CDR twain) I had caller use a good known sensor she connected a Schick Elite sensor and 2.0 interface, this one worked after a couple of tries. Connected the 3.0 and the Schick 33 sensor, PC light is on, sensor light is off (although is connected) __________________",
