      "notes_text": "Note\r\n11.07.2025          15:28:27            Jen Brown (TRJJB112)\r\n\r\nThis issue has been troubleshooted and was determined to be related to software or connectivity related within the office and is considered routine servicing.  These requests are monitored for trend monthly at the Product Surveillance Committee (PSC) meeting.\r\n\r\nPlease close ticket upon resolution for the customer.\r\n\r\n__________________\r\n\r\nProblem Description\r\n10.07.2025          23:52:59            Melvin Felix (MFELIX)\r\n\r\nJadeline called to have driver installed for 33 sensor.\r\n__________________\r\n\r\nSolution Description\r\n10.07.2025          23:52:59            Melvin Felix (MFELIX)\r\n\r\n--------INITIAL LOG-------- 07/10/2025 5:50:43 PM (Dentsply Sirona Charlotte Time)\r\n\r\nWarranty: 08/29/2019\r\nDealer on-site:\r\nBillable: Y\r\nBilling Accepted: N\r\nBilling Approved By:\r\n90 Day Expiration Date: 10/08/2025\r\n\r\nRemote Access:\r\nSidexis Version:\r\nServer Location:\r\nPDATA Remote Location:\r\nRCU Location (If Applicable):\r\nPractice Management:\r\nWorkstation(s):\r\nScout Check:\r\n\r\nFirmware:\r\nPlug-in Version:\r\nExposure Count:\r\nUnit IP Address:\r\n\r\nTroubleshooting Details: Will ask need permission for service fee will call back.\r\n\r\nFunctional Test Successful / Follow Up:\r\n\r\n__________________\r\n\r\nLog\r\n10.07.2025          23:51:22            Melvin Felix (MFELIX)\r\nNote\r\n10.07.2025          23:51:22            Melvin Felix (MFELIX)\r\n\r\n__ Initial ticket creation __\r\n\r\n__________________",
