      "notes_text": "Note\r\n15.07.2025          19:54:56            Jen Brown (TRJJB112)\r\n\r\nThis issue has been troubleshooted and it was determined that a part of the system must be replaced.\r\nReplacement part has been recommended.  Complaints are monitored for trend monthly for the Product Surveillance Committee (PSC) meeting.\r\n\r\nPlease close complaint upon appropriate resolution for the customer.\r\n\r\n__________________\r\n\r\nCustomer Note\r\n15.07.2025          00:02:09            Rebecca Buck (RBUCK)\r\n\r\nThank you for posting the pictures.\r\n__________________\r\n\r\nNote\r\n14.07.2025          18:25:06             UC4BATCH (UC4BATCH)\r\nNew Attachment IMG_2024-08-27_16-13-00.jpg was added!New Attachment  was added!New Attachment IMG_2025-07-14_12-10-07.jpg was added!New Attachment IMG_2025-07-14_12-06-35.jpg was added!\r\n__________________\r\n\r\nNote\r\n14.07.2025          18:25:05             UC4BATCH (UC4BATCH)\r\nNew Attachment IMG_2024-08-27_16-13-00.jpg was added!New Attachment  was added!New Attachment IMG_2025-07-14_12-10-07.jpg was added!New Attachment IMG_2025-07-14_12-06-35.jpg was added!\r\n__________________\r\n\r\nNote\r\n14.07.2025          18:25:04             UC4BATCH (UC4BATCH)\r\nNew Attachment IMG_2024-08-27_16-13-00.jpg was added!New Attachment  was added!New Attachment IMG_2025-07-14_12-10-07.jpg was added!New Attachment IMG_2025-07-14_12-06-35.jpg was added!\r\n__________________\r\n\r\nNote\r\n14.07.2025          18:25:04             UC4BATCH (UC4BATCH)\r\nNew Attachment IMG_2024-08-27_16-13-00.jpg was added!New Attachment  was added!New Attachment IMG_2025-07-14_12-10-07.jpg was added!New Attachment IMG_2025-07-14_12-06-35.jpg was added!\r\n__________________\r\n\r\n\r\nSolution Description\r\n14.07.2025          18:24:24            Rebecca Buck (RBUCK)\r\n\r\nThey are using the wrong cleaner.\r\nGave part number for new sensor.\r\nExplained care with original Cavi Wipes.\r\n\r\nThey need to upgrade Sidexis to 4.4or stay on 4.3.1 and use 2.2 driver.\r\nOld drivers not supported in W11.\r\n\r\n__________________\r\nProblem Description\r\n14.07.2025          18:24:02            Rebecca Buck (RBUCK)\r\n\r\nArtifact in sensor\r\n\r\n--------INITIAL LOG-------- 07/14/2025 12:01:10 PM (Dentsply Sirona Charlotte Time)\r\n\r\nWarranty: No\r\nDealer on-site: Yes\r\n\r\nRemote Access: Yes\r\nSidexis Version:4.3.1\r\nServer Location:\\\\voorhees-img-g\\PDATA\\Setup\\Sidexis4\r\nPDATA Remote Location:\r\nRCU Location (If Applicable):\r\nPractice Management:\r\nWorkstation(s):VOORHEES53\r\nScout Check:\r\n\r\nFirmware:1.5.121\r\nPlug-in Version:1.1\r\n\r\nTroubleshooting Details:\r\nHe said there is water stain artifact on sensor.\r\nSee Attached.\r\n\r\nThey are using the wrong cleaner.\r\nGave part number for new sensor.\r\nExplained care with original Cavi Wipes.\r\n\r\nThey need to upgrade Sidexis to 4.4or stay on 4.3.1 and use 2.2 driver.\r\nOld drivers not supported in W11.\r\n\r\nFunctional Test Successful / Follow Up:\r\nGave him part number and told him they will need to upgrade with W11.\r\n\r\n__________________\r\nNote\r\n14.07.2025          18:02:54            Rebecca Buck (RBUCK)\r\n\r\n__ Initial ticket creation __\r\n\r\n__________________\r\n\r\n\r\nLog\r\n14.07.2025          18:02:53            Rebecca Buck (RBUCK)",
