      "problem_description": "Artifact in sensor Warranty: No Dealer on-site: Yes Remote Access: Yes Sidexis Version:4.3.1 Server Location:\\\\voorhees-img-g\\PDATA\\Setup\\Sidexis4 PDATA Remote Location: RCU Location (If Applicable): Practice Management: Workstation(s):VOORHEES53 Scout Check: Firmware:1.5.121 Plug-in Version:1.1 Troubleshooting Details: He said there is water stain artifact on sensor. See Attached. They are using the wrong cleaner. Gave part number for new sensor. Explained care with original Cavi Wipes. They need to upgrade Sidexis to 4.4or stay on 4.3.1 and use 2.2 driver. Old drivers not supported in W11. Functional Test Successful / Follow Up: Gave him part number and told him they will need to upgrade with W11. Note __ Initial ticket creation __ Log",
      "problem_summary": "artifact in sensor",
      "solution_summary": "for the customer. __________________ Customer Note 15.07.2025 00:02:09 Rebecca Buck (RBUCK) Thank you for posting the pictures. __________________ Note 14.07.2025 18:25:06 UC4BATCH (UC4BATCH) New Attachment IMG_2024-08-27_16-13-00.jpg was added!New Attachment was added!New Attachment IMG_2025-07-14_12-10-07.jpg was added!New Attachment IMG_2025-07-14_12-06-35.jpg was added! __________________ Note 14.07.2025 18:25:05 UC4BATCH (UC4BATCH) New Attachment IMG_2024-08-27_16-13-00.jpg was added!New Attachment was added!New Attachment IMG_2025-07-14_12-10-07.jpg was added!New Attachment IMG_2025-07-14_12-06-35.jpg was added! __________________ Note 14.07.2025 18:25:04 UC4BATCH (UC4BATCH) New Attachment IMG_2024-08-27_16-13-00.jpg was added!New Attachment was added!New Attachment IMG_2025-07-14_12-10-07.jpg was added!New Attachment IMG_2025-07-14_12-06-35.jpg was added! __________________ Note 14.07.2025 18:25:04 UC4BATCH (UC4BATCH) New Attachment IMG_2024-08-27_16-13-00.jpg was added!New Attachment was added!New Attachment IMG_2025-07-14_12-10-07.jpg was added!New Attachment IMG_2025-07-14_12-06-35.jpg was added! __________________ Solution Description 14.07.2025 18:24:24 Rebecca Buck (RBUCK) They are using the wrong cleaner. Gave part number for new sensor. Explained care with original Cavi Wipes. They need to upgrade Sidexis to 4.4or stay on 4.3.1 and use 2.2 driver. Old drivers not supported in W11. __________________"
