      "description_text": "schick 33 sensor intermittent connection",
      "notes_text": "Note\r\n17.07.2025          18:18:21            David Mottley (DMOTTLEY)\r\n\r\n__  Further Action __\r\n------FURTHER ACTION-------  07/17/2025 10:41:39 AM (Dentsply Sirona Charlotte Time)\r\n\r\nCallers Full Name: Kirsty and IT\r\nCallers Phone Number:5193000238\r\nCallers Role:IT\r\n\r\nWarranty Status:n\r\nBilling Previously Accepted:\r\n\r\nProblem Description:\r\n\r\nThe sensors are not working in any room\r\n\r\nhttps://www.dentsplysironasupport.com/content/dam/master/product-procedure-brand-categories/imaging/product-categories/software/schick-software/AE%20USB%20Firmware%20Upgrade.zip\r\n\r\n\r\nTroubleshooting Description:\r\nTwo sensors sn . 25050461,  24022530\r\n\r\nHYG1\r\nThe are using  tracker and\r\n25050461\r\n2 Sensor\r\nThe remote needs a firmware update from 1.5.121 to 1.5.141 Sn. 2033258\r\nThey have the cable clip\r\nPower management\r\nDirect plug into the computer\r\n\r\nHYG2\r\n\r\nChecked the remote firmware and updated the firmware to 1.5.140\r\nsn. 2033402 and 24022530\r\n\r\nKrristy will test later\r\n\r\n\r\nHYG3\r\n\r\nThe Interface needs update.\r\nSn. 2027361\r\n\r\n\r\nHYG 4\r\nsn. 2020106\r\n\r\nRoom HYG 4 is down becuase the xray unit needs an exposure switch\r\n\r\n\r\nSolution Description:\r\n\r\nSuggest the look at sensor cable since they have\r\n\r\n\r\nFunctional (Yes/No):y\r\n\r\n__________________\r\n\r\nNote\r\n17.07.2025          16:27:53            Jen Brown (TRJJB112)\r\n\r\nThis issue has been troubleshooted and it was determined that a part of the system must be replaced.\r\nReplacement part has been recommended.  Complaints are monitored for trend monthly for the Product Surveillance Committee (PSC) meeting.\r\n\r\nPlease close complaint upon appropriate resolution for the customer.\r\n\r\n__________________\r\n\r\nNote\r\n16.07.2025          20:43:20            Keenan Jordan (KJORDAN)\r\n\r\n__  Further Action __\r\n------FURTHER ACTION-------  07/16/2025 1:44:49 PM (Dentsply Sirona Charlotte Time)\r\n\r\nCallers Full Name: Kirsty\r\nCallers Phone Number:  519-672-2920\r\nCallers Role: staff\r\n\r\nFurther Action Issue / Request:\r\n\r\nSensor not working\r\n\r\nChecking the driver software\r\n\r\nRemote Access: TV\r\nSidexis Version: N/A\r\nServer Location: N/A\r\nPDATA Remote Location: N/A\r\nRCU Location (If Applicable):\r\nPractice Management: Tracker\r\nWorkstation(s): HYG1,  HYG3 and HGY2\r\nScout Check: Yes\r\n\r\nFirmware:\r\nPlug-in Version: 1.133\r\nExposure Count:\r\nUnit IP Address:\r\n\r\nTroubleshooting Details:\r\n\r\nOffice only have the Sensor Schick AE USB Support For CDR driver installed.\r\n\r\nPhone Call dropped\r\n\r\nCalled back and continuing with the trouble shooting.\r\n\r\nSN: 2020106 Schick 3.0 Interface box.\r\n\r\nNeed to replace the interface box.\r\n\r\nChecking WK HYG3 and repairing a few C++ MSXML SP and rebooting.\r\n\r\nWorking now.\r\n\r\nFunctional Test Successful / Follow Up:\r\n\r\nOffice need a new interface module.\r\n\r\n100008290 SCHICK 3.0 USB INTERFACE, RMA\r\n\r\n__________________\r\n\r\nNote\r\n16.07.2025          16:24:31            Talia Nastacio (TNASTACIO)\r\n\r\n__  Further Action __\r\n------FURTHER ACTION-------  07/16/2025 10:14:59 AM (Dentsply Sirona Charlotte Time)\r\n\r\nCallers Full Name: Kirsty\r\nCallers Phone Number:  519-672-2920\r\nCallers Role: staff\r\n\r\nWarranty Status: OOW\r\nBilling Previously Accepted: N/A - Canadian Customer\r\n\r\nProblem Description: OOW\r\nThe office is still having issues with the sensor connectivity. They  swapped with another USB and even another sensor and found the issue is present on this PC, but works fine on another. She then mentioned the drivers may be part of the issue. She stated they had drivers updated when the sensor had issues with image quality and that the suspected USB is working fine on that PC.\r\n\r\nTroubleshooting Description:\r\nRequested to connect to the working PC to see how it is configured and would do the same on PC that is not working\r\n\r\nShe connected me to HYG2 which is the PC not working, only AE USB v. 1.1 is installed\r\nthe working PC is not available....\r\n\r\nSolution Description:\r\nThey will call back when we can see how the working PC is setup\r\n\r\nFunctional (Yes/No): No\r\n\r\n__________________\r\n\r\nProblem Description\r\n15.07.2025          18:07:37            John Morris (JMORRIS)\r\n\r\nSchick 33 sensor intermittent connection\r\n\r\n--------INITIAL LOG-------- 07/15/2025 12:02:06 PM (Dentsply Sirona Charlotte Time)\r\n\r\nWarranty: Yes\r\nDealer on-site: No\r\nBillable: No\r\nBilling Accepted:  No\r\nDetails: Inquiry\r\n\r\nFollow Up: Office suspects they have a bad USB interface --\r\nSensor works w/o issue in all ops except DentalStudioLondonNorth\r\nHad staff inspect USB connections and they appear to be fine\r\nUSB interface is suspect\r\n__________________\r\n\r\nSolution Description\r\n15.07.2025          18:07:37            John Morris (JMORRIS)\r\n\r\nSolution Description: Staff will swap out USB with a known good box to see if issue occurs\r\nIf further troubleshooting indicates USB issue, staff will call back for RMA PN\r\n\r\n\r\nFunctional (Yes/No):\r\n\r\n\r\n__________________\r\n\r\nLog\r\n15.07.2025          18:07:37            John Morris (JMORRIS)\r\nNote\r\n15.07.2025          18:07:37            John Morris (JMORRIS)\r\n\r\n__ Initial ticket creation __\r\n\r\n__________________",
