      "notes_text": "Note\r\n17.07.2025          17:51:30            Jen Brown (TRJJB112)\r\n\r\nThis issue has been troubleshooted and was determined to be related to software or connectivity related within the office and is considered routine servicing.  These requests are monitored for trend monthly at the Product Surveillance Committee (PSC) meeting.\r\n\r\nPlease close ticket.\r\n\r\n__________________\r\n\r\n\r\nSolution Description\r\n15.07.2025          19:36:39            Elhadji Seye (SELHADJI)\r\n\r\n--------INITIAL LOG-------- 07/15/2025 12:13:58 PM (Dentsply Sirona Charlotte Time)\r\n\r\nWarranty: Yes\r\nDealer on-site: No\r\nBillable: No\r\nBilling Accepted:\r\nBilling Approved By:\r\n90 Day Expiration Date: 10/13/2025\r\n\r\nRemote Access: TV\r\nSidexis Version: Sidexis 4.3.1\r\nServer Location:  Server\r\nPDATA Remote Location:\r\nRCU Location (If Applicable):\r\nPractice Management:\r\nWorkstation(s): OP1, OP2.\r\nScout Check:\r\n\r\nFirmware:\r\nPlug-in Version:\r\nExposure Count:\r\nUnit IP Address:\r\n\r\nTroubleshooting Details: I remoted in and found a lot of interfaces listed on Sidexis. I removed all the network devices and restarted Sidexis service. Now he can take Xray again in OP1. On OP2, the program hangs on retrieving templates. I has to update the prerequisites and reinstalled Sidexis 4 client and the plugin. I also had to restart the Sidexis service when Sidexis stopped responding on all workstations. Now it works fine on all the workstations. We talked about his coming server migration on Aug 1st.\r\n\r\nFunctional Test Successful / Follow Up:\r\nK Smiles Dental Care\r\n__________________\r\nProblem Description\r\n15.07.2025          19:07:45            Elhadji Seye (SELHADJI)\r\n\r\nHe said that there an error message when he wants to take Xray.\r\n__________________\r\n\r\nLog\r\n15.07.2025          18:12:35            Elhadji Seye (SELHADJI)\r\nNote\r\n15.07.2025          18:12:35            Elhadji Seye (SELHADJI)\r\n\r\n__ Initial ticket creation __\r\n\r\n__________________",
