Charlotte Time)\r\n\r\nWarranty:\r\nDealer on-site:\r\nBillable: No\r\nDetails: Inquiry\r\n\r\nFollow Up: using legacy drivers\r\nnot support. Willing to look for raw data\r\nbut office did not have time.\r\n\r\n__________________\r\n\r\nLog\r\n15.07.2025          18:19:04            Jerome Miller (JMILLER1)",
