      "notes_text": "Note\r\n29.07.2025          21:54:07            Seth Woodward (SWOODWARD)\r\n\r\n__  Further Action __\r\n------FURTHER ACTION-------  07/29/2025 3:47:46 PM (Dentsply Sirona Charlotte Time)\r\n\r\nCallers Full Name: Lauren Koenig\r\nCallers Phone Number: 917-850-9999\r\nCallers Role: office\r\n\r\nWarranty Status:Yes\r\nBilling Previously Accepted: NA\r\n\r\nProblem Description: still not getting connection to the sensor after sensor cable replacement\r\n\r\nTroubleshooting Description: this sensor was purchased January of 2025 - under warranty\r\n\r\n\r\nSolution Description: recommend replacement sensor\r\n\r\n\r\nFunctional (Yes/No): No\r\n\r\n__________________\r\n\r\nNote\r\n22.07.2025          00:13:04            Armando Santacruz (ASANTACRUZ)\r\n\r\n__  Further Action __\r\n------FURTHER ACTION-------  07/21/2025 5:57:18 PM (Dentsply Sirona Charlotte Time)\r\n\r\nCallers Full Name: Lopez\r\nCallers Phone Number: 9168509999\r\nCallers Role: office\r\n\r\nWarranty Status: warranty\r\nBilling Previously Accepted:\r\n\r\nProblem Description: sensor side of\r\n\r\nTroubleshooting Description:\r\nsensor firmware 3.4\r\nusb current\r\n\r\nSolution Description:user swapped cable and stated they have to place cable in a special way\r\nhas old driver\r\nhave green light now and took sevearl shots and no issues\r\n\r\nadvised that we go with curve new interface if they can get it\r\ncurrent version not supported\r\n\r\nadvised will need curve to supply newer capture module and for SW to be removed and configured for IOSS 3 as the next step\r\n\r\nworking now\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nFunctional (Yes/No): yes for now\r\n\r\n__________________\r\n\r\nNote\r\n17.07.2025          17:52:50            Jen Brown (TRJJB112)\r\n\r\nThis issue has been troubleshooted and it was determined that a part of the system must be replaced.\r\nReplacement part has been recommended.  Complaints are monitored for trend monthly for the Product Surveillance Committee (PSC) meeti