office has switched\r\ncable and isuse has went away\r\n\r\nPART PTC PROCESSING RMA FOR: 6ft 2.0 cable\r\n\r\n+++\r\n+++\r\n\r\n__________________\r\n\r\nProblem Description\r\n15.07.2025          18:41:14             CPIC_SIMO (CPIC_SIMO)\r\n\r\nDetails: Issue Reported: would show blue and yellow flash unitll they went to take images then owuld turn red\r\n\r\nEquipment Type and M\r\nodel: sze 1 sensor and 2.0 cable\r\n\r\nSerial Number:us517731  24022452 sze one\r\n\r\nAcquisition Software & Version: pi 17\r\n\r\nIssue in One o\r\nr All Rooms:one room\r\n\r\nOther Sensors work with working Remotes in Room(s) with Issue: yes\r\n\r\nPC Name:op 3\r\n\r\nSchick Driver Version (Pr\r\nograms and features): ioss\r\n\r\nRemote FW/FPGA Version: _____ Sensor FW Version:  _____\r\n\r\nIf Remote Issue:na\r\n\r\n2.0 or 3.0: Tried Differen\r\nt USB Cable/USB Port/Bypassed USB hubs/Extenders:na\r\n\r\n3.0 Remote: Tried on a 3.0 AND 2.0 USB port/cable clip connected:na\r\n\r\nIf Senso\r\nr Issue, Replaced Elastomer:  yes\r\n\r\nIf Sensor Issue, Tried Different Sensor Cable:changing cable has resolved issue accourding to of\r\nfice\r\n\r\nIf no response to radiation, confirmed Xray Head Functional:yes\r\n\r\nAdditional Troubleshooting Steps/Notes:office has switched\r\ncable and isuse has went away\r\n\r\nPART PTC PROCESSING RMA FOR: 6ft 2.0 cable\r\n\r\n+++\r\n+++\r\n\r\n__________________\r\n\r\nLog\r\n15.07.2025          18:41:14             CPIC_SIMO (CPIC_SIMO)",
