      "notes_text": "Note\r\n17.07.2025          18:00:23            Jen Brown (TRJJB112)\r\n\r\nThis issue has been troubleshooted and was determined to be related to software or connectivity related within the office and is considered routine servicing.  These requests are monitored for trend monthly at the Product Surveillance Committee (PSC) meeting.\r\n\r\nPlease close ticket.\r\n\r\n__________________\r\n\r\n\r\nSolution Description\r\n15.07.2025          23:12:58            Sebastian Cedeno (SCEDENO)\r\n\r\nSolution Description: uninstalling the legacy driver, installing prereqs and IOSS 3.2 solved the issue.\r\n\r\n\r\nFunctional (Yes/No): Yes. Both the old and new box work with IOSS 3.2, took a few test images successfully.\r\n\r\n\r\n__________________\r\nProblem Description\r\n15.07.2025          23:01:55            Sebastian Cedeno (SCEDENO)\r\n\r\nSchick driver install assistance\r\n\r\n--------INITIAL LOG-------- 07/15/2025 4:30:37 PM (Dentsply Sirona Charlotte Time)\r\n\r\nWarranty: yes (ERP date 02/25/2025)\r\nDealer on-site: no\r\nBillable: no\r\nBilling Accepted: na\r\nBilling Approved By: na\r\n90 Day Expiration Date: 10/13/2025\r\n\r\nRemote Access: yes\r\nSidexis Version: na\r\nServer Location: na\r\nPDATA Remote Location: na\r\nRCU Location (If Applicable): na\r\nPractice Management: Curve Capture\r\nWorkstation(s): OP6\r\nScout Check: yes\r\n\r\nFirmware: 1.5.121\r\nPlug-in Version: 3.2\r\nExposure Count: na\r\nUnit IP Address: na\r\n\r\nTroubleshooting Description: remoted into OP6, checked driver installed, they have the legacy 5.16 driver.\r\nUninstalled the driver, then installed IOSS 3.2\r\nPerformed firmware upgrade to 1.5.140.\r\nNoticed Curve Capture crashing, uninstalled/reinstalled their prereqs.\r\nTook a series of images successfully.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n__________________\r\n\r\nLog\r\n15.07.2025          22:31:08            Sebastian Cedeno (SCEDENO)\r\nNote\r\n15.07.2025          22:31:08            Sebastian Cedeno (SCEDENO)\r\n\r\n__ Initial ticket creation __\r\n\r\n__________________",
