      "notes_text": "Note\r\n02.09.2025          14:21:02            Armando Santacruz (ASANTACRUZ)\r\n\r\n__  Further Action __\r\nClosed per J. Brown\r\n__________________\r\n\r\nNote\r\n02.09.2025          14:08:58            Jen Brown (TRJJB112)\r\n\r\nThis issue has been troubleshooted further and it was determined that a part of the system must be replaced.\r\nReplacement part has been recommended.  Complaints are monitored for trend monthly for the Product Surveillance Committee (PSC) meeting.\r\nPlease close complaint upon appropriate resolution for the customer.\r\n\r\n__________________\r\n\r\nNote\r\n28.08.2025          15:37:00            Benjamin Magalhaes (BMAGALHAES)\r\n\r\n__  Further Action __\r\n------FURTHER ACTION-------  08/28/2025 9:12:27 AM (Dentsply Sirona Charlotte Time)\r\n\r\nCallers Full Name: Derek Narducci\r\nCallers Phone Number: 617-201-1308\r\nCallers Role: Dealer Tech\r\n\r\nWarranty Status: ?\r\nBilling Previously Accepted: Tech onsite but warranty still uncertain.\r\n\r\nProblem Description:\r\n\r\nSensor not working.\r\n\r\nThey dont get detected on eaglesoft....\r\n\r\nCustomer says it is intermittent. but tech has not been able to get it working.\r\n\r\nInterface cuts in and out of device manager tech says that it also lights turn off when its doing this.\r\n\r\nUnplugged sensor from interface it stops cutting in and out...\r\n\r\nThis all only happens with two specific sensors.... a known working sensor works right away.\r\n\r\nTroubleshooting Description:\r\n\r\n\r\nSolution Description:\r\n\r\nTech has replaced cables and elastomer.... still same issues no changes.\r\n\r\nThe two sensor serial number:\r\n\r\n25040102\r\n\r\n16002546\r\n\r\nSensors need to be replaced due to symptoms issue is sensor related.\r\n\r\nPart numbers:\r\n\r\nB1218051\r\n\r\nB1318051\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nFunctional (Yes/No):\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n__________________\r\n\r\nNote\r\n18.08.2025          15:44:57            Melvin Felix (MFELIX)\r\n\r\n__  Further Action __\r\n------FURTHER ACTION-------  08/18/2025 9:38:59 AM (Dentsply Sirona Charlotte Time)\r\n\r\nCallers Full Name:  Ann Reed\r\nCallers Phone Number: 8157570443\r\nCallers Role: Office:\r\n\r\nBilling Previously Accepted:\r\nBilling Accepted:\r\nBilling Approved By:\r\n\r\nFurther Action Issue / Request:\r\n\r\nTroubleshooting Details: Office will contact Henry Schein to come out to look at the sensors.\r\n\r\nFunctional Test Successful / Follow Up:\r\n\r\n__________________\r\n\r\nCustomer Note\r\n15.08.2025          22:43:10             CPIC_SIMO (CPIC_SIMO)\r\n\r\nAdditional information provided by Guest User:\r\nI would like to set up a service call to our office that corresponds with this service request #8001262445.\r\nPlease send response to annr@concordpediatricdentistry.com\r\nThank you\r\n__________________\r\n\r\nNote\r\n05.08.2025          15:01:56            Armando Santacruz (ASANTACRUZ)\r\n\r\n__  Further Action __\r\nclosing ticket per J. Brown\r\n__________________\r\n\r\nNote\r\n05.08.2025          14:04:18            Jen Brown (TRJJB112)\r\n\r\nIt cannot be determined from the information provided if this issue is software or hardware related.  It will be kept as a service ticket unless additional information can be provided by the customer.\r\n\r\nPlease close ticket upon appropriate resolution for the customer.\r\n\r\n__________________\r\n\r\nProblem Description\r\n16.07.2025          20:46:35            Sebastian Cedeno (SCEDENO)\r\n\r\nSchick sensor intermittent connectivity\r\n\r\n--------INITIAL LOG-------- 07/16/2025 2:43:57 PM (Dentsply Sirona Charlotte Time)\r\n\r\nWarranty: (unknown, ship date 2021-08-12)\r\nDealer on-site: no\r\nBillable: No\r\n\r\nDetails: explained sensor has a 2 year warranty, we would need an invoice for the correct warranty status.\r\n\r\n__________________\r\n\r\nSolution Description\r\n16.07.2025          20:46:35            Sebastian Cedeno (SCEDENO)\r\n\r\nSolution Description: Ann will try to find the invoice for these sensors, she is aware of the service fee for the out of warranty devices.\r\n\r\n\r\nFunctional (Yes/No): NA\r\n\r\n\r\n__________________\r\n\r\nLog\r\n16.07.2025          20:44:31            Sebastian Cedeno (SCEDENO)\r\nNote\r\n16.07.2025          20:44:31            Sebastian Cedeno (SCEDENO)\r\n\r\n__ Initial ticket creation __\r\n\r\n__________________\r\n\r\n************************Recomm. Spare parts ************************\r\n\r\nProblem Description\r\n28.08.2025          15:34:11            Benjamin Magalhaes (BMAGALHAES)\r\n\r\n\r\nB1218051\r\n\r\n\r\n__________________",
