      "notes_text": "Note\r\n17.07.2025          18:48:46            Jen Brown (TRJJB112)\r\n\r\nThis issue has been troubleshooted and it was determined that a part of the system must be replaced.\r\nReplacement part has been recommended.  Complaints are monitored for trend monthly for the Product Surveillance Committee (PSC) meeting.\r\n\r\nPlease close complaint upon appropriate resolution for the customer.\r\n\r\n__________________\r\n\r\n\r\nSolution Description\r\n16.07.2025          22:33:25            Taylor Bledsoe (DIIDF904)\r\n\r\nSolution:\r\n\r\nConfirmed warranty status, sensor and USB module are from the same kit with an ERP creation date in 2024, well within warranty.\r\n\r\nFailing sensor: 25060280\r\nreplacing with PN 100008651\r\n\r\nFailing USB interface: 2033301\r\nreplacing with PN 100008290\r\n\r\n__________________\r\nProblem Description\r\n16.07.2025          22:32:46            Taylor Bledsoe (DIIDF904)\r\n\r\n--------INITIAL LOG-------- 07/16/2025 4:31:23 PM (Dentsply Sirona Charlotte Time)\r\n\r\nWarranty: YES\r\nDealer on-site: NO\r\nBillable: No\r\nDetails: Inquiry\r\n\r\nFollow Up:\r\n\r\nPractice reports via their IT that they have a sensor and a USB interface that they have tested with other sensors/interfaces/cables/PCs, these two components are consistently failing, the sensor cable does appear to work with other sensors/interfaces though.\r\n\r\nFailing sensor: 25060280\r\nreplacing with PN 100008651\r\n\r\nFailing USB interface: 2033301\r\nreplacing with PN 100008290\r\n\r\n__________________\r\n\r\nLog\r\n16.07.2025          22:32:46            Taylor Bledsoe (DIIDF904)\r\nNote\r\n16.07.2025          22:32:46            Taylor Bledsoe (DIIDF904)\r\n\r\n__ Initial ticket creation __\r\n\r\n__________________",
