      "notes_text": "Note\r\n17.07.2025          18:52:32            Jen Brown (TRJJB112)\r\n\r\nThis issue has been troubleshooted and was determined to be related to software or connectivity related within the office and is considered routine servicing.  These requests are monitored for trend monthly at the Product Surveillance Committee (PSC) meeting.\r\n\r\nPlease close ticket.\r\n\r\n__________________\r\n\r\nProblem Description\r\n16.07.2025          23:09:45            Robert Jean (RJEAN)\r\n\r\nContinuation # 8001244711\r\n\r\n\r\nthis device is currently in use by another session after CAD cAM worked on her machine..\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nNote\r\n07/08/2025          17:01:58            Rebecca Buck (RBUCK)\r\n\r\n__  Further Action __\r\n------FURTHER ACTION-------  07/08/2025 3:09:49 PM (Dentsply Sirona Charlotte Time)\r\n\r\nCallers Full Name: Anna Lomas\r\nCallers Phone Number: 281-712-7271\r\nCallers Role: OM\r\n\r\nFurther Action Issue / Request:\r\nFound OP2 is having odd issues.\r\nShe should contact IT with issues I see in screenshot of core Isolation. See Attached.\r\nDuplicate IP of X-ray is still issue.\r\nLeft screenshot on OP2\r\nNeed TS to install chair plug-ins on OP1 and OP2.\r\n\r\nTroubleshooting Details:\r\nGot each workstation installed and tested with Sidexis link.\r\nAdded IT to call.\r\nAlejandro helped us.\r\n\r\nHe had Anna remove USB dongle from new rcu that had gone into the disk scan.\r\nHe talked her into trying to get into pc from safe mode.\r\nIt seems to have a failed drive.\r\nThey had removed drives to fix original pc.\r\nThey will send someone on site to fix it tomorrow and call us to move Acquisition service.\r\n\r\nI had him scan for IP.\r\nFound SERVER00 has x-ray ip 192.168.15.11.\r\nConfigured X-ray to 192.168.15.90.\r\nPulled details.\r\nAttached.\r\n\r\nFirmware: 5.12.06\r\nPlug-in Version:1.22\r\nExposure Count:1016\r\nUnit IP Address: 192.168.15.90\r\n\r\nDownloaded new Galiloes Implant and DB.\r\nTested and then put in the Sidexis link icon in ES.\r\nTested and it failed.\r\nX-ray is out of Sync and ready.\r\nHad her reboot and test.\r\nOkay.\r\nShowed her how to use Sidexis link.\r\n\r\nDid session on  OP1 and install Galileos Implant and DB and ES link.\r\nTested. okay.\r\nShe will call for TS tomorrow.\r\n\r\nFunctional Test Successful / Follow Up:\r\nTo Do:\r\n1.TS for Chair plug ins.\r\n2.Set up new Pano pc.\r\n3.Move SQL DB to Server.\r\nLeft note on OP2:\r\n\r\nCall ES support to address errors and configure to Twain capture in Schick if you want to take images there.\r\nIf you upgrade to ES 24.20 there is different driver and direct integration with templates.\r\n\r\nYou can switch to Sidexis for full imaging if you choose, in this version.\r\n\r\nTo take images in ES until you have ES fix.\r\nOpen ES and cancel CDR error.\r\nRight click image in template and select scanner.\r\nDo not have Sidexis open with ES while trying to take image\r\n\r\nTraining and help sites\r\nhttps://www.dentsplysironasupport.com/en-us/user_section/user_section_imaging/software-and-tutorials.html\r\n\r\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=5mR63kmiam0&list=PLBXfO9xH7kdjc0NmBfIDFnMY3tXZZ3UtN&index=10\r\n\r\nTo Do:\r\n1.TS for Chair plug ins.\r\n2.Set up new Pano pc.\r\n3.Move SQL DB to Server.\r\n\r\n\r\n__________________\r\n\r\nProblem Description\r\n07/08/2025          15:23:42            Rebecca Buck (RBUCK)\r\n\r\nPrevious Billed ticket # 1224165\r\n\r\nWarranty: No\r\nDealer on-site: No\r\nBillable: Yes\r\nBilling Accepted:  Yes\r\nBilling Approved By:  Dr Alethea Kypriotakis\r\n90 Day Expiration Date: 08/06/2025\r\n\r\nRemote Access: yes\r\nSidexis Version: 4.3.1\r\nServer Location: DOCTOR-PC\r\nPDATA Remote Location:  \\\\SERVER01\\PDATA\r\nRCU:Doctor -pc to CDG2506Pano failed. Still on Doctor-PC\r\nPractice Management: ES 21\r\nWorkstation(s): CDG2506OP2 & CD2506Pano\r\nScout Check:\r\n\r\nFirmware: 2.38\r\nPlug-in Version: 2.2\r\nSensor #2504992\r\nExposure Count:\r\nUnit IP Address: 192.168.15.240\r\nTroubleshooting Details:\r\n\r\n\r\n__________________\r\nNote\r\n07/08/2025          14:39:27            Rebecca Buck (RBUCK)\r\n\r\n__  Further Action __\r\n------FURTHER ACTION-------  07/08/2025 12:48:06 PM (Dentsply Sirona Charlotte Time)\r\n\r\nCallers Full Name: Rayan Albasam.\r\nCallers Phone Number: 281-712-7271\r\nCallers Role: lab staff\r\n\r\nBilling Previously Accepted: Yes\r\nBilling Accepted:  Yes\r\nBilling Approved By:  Dr Alethea Kypriotakis\r\n90 Day Expiration Date: 08/06/2025\r\n\r\nRemote Access: yes\r\nSidexis Version: 4.3.1\r\nServer Location: DOCTOR-PC 192.168.15.102\r\nPDATA Remote Location: SERVER01 192.168.15.10\r\nRCU Location (If Applicable):CDG2506 Pano  192.168.15.114\r\nPractice Management: ES\r\nWorkstation(s):CDG2506OP2 & CD2506Pano & CDG2506OP1\r\nScout Check:\r\n\r\nFirmware:\r\nPlug-in Version: 1.22\r\nExposure Count:\r\nUnit IP Address: 192.168.15.11\r\n\r\nTroubleshooting Details:\r\nCalled back office and after fixing OP2 worked on new Acquisition Server =CD2506Pano.\r\nGave him numbered installers.\r\n\r\nFound IP of X-ray taken by other device. 3C-ec-ef-df-a4-61.\r\nHe found pc with IP and shut it off.\r\nStill showing duplicate.\r\nRebooted this pc.\r\n\r\nHe found system scan on drive on reboot of CD2506Pano.\r\nFixing E stalled pc @ 48% (1 1/2hours to finish)\r\nOM Anna arrived at office and called IT support and told them.\r\nThey will call them back.\r\n\r\nDid session on OP1\r\nNothing installed.\r\nTurned off Core Isolation and rebooted.\r\nUsed Tech toolbox to install all missing features and C++.\r\n\r\nInstalled Sidexis Schick 2.2 plug-in and twain\r\n\r\nOP2 locked up on twain into ES.\r\nDid session and tested.\r\nHad him take blanks to try to make it fail.\r\nIt did not.\r\nAttached sensor logs.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nFunctional Test Successful / Follow Up:\r\nNeeded to send to TS support for Chair plug-ins.\r\n__________________\r\n\r\nNote\r\n07/08/2025          12:43:14            Rebecca Buck (RBUCK)\r\n\r\n__  Further Action __\r\n------FURTHER ACTION-------  07/08/2025 11:07:37 AM (Dentsply Sirona Charlotte Time)\r\n\r\nCallers Full Name: Rayan Albasam\r\nCallers Phone Number: 281-712-7271\r\nCallers Role: Staff\r\n\r\nPrevious Billed ticket # 1224165\r\n\r\nWarranty: No\r\nDealer on-site: No\r\nBillable: Yes\r\nBilling Accepted:  Yes\r\nBilling Approved By:  Dr Alethea Kypriotakis\r\n90 Day Expiration Date: 08/06/2025\r\n\r\nRemote Access: yes\r\nSidexis Version: 4.3.1\r\nServer Location: \\\\SERVER01\\PDATA\r\nPDATA Remote Location:  \\\\SERVER01\\PDATA\r\nRCU: from Doctor -pc to CDG2506Pano  192.168.15.114\r\nPractice Management: ES 21\r\nWorkstation(s): CDG2506OP2 & CD2506Pano\r\nScout Check:\r\n\r\nFirmware: 2.38\r\nPlug-in Version: 2.2\r\nSensor #2504992\r\nExposure Count:\r\nUnit IP Address: 192.168.15.240\r\n\r\nTroubleshooting Details:\r\nCalled office back and did session on OP2 and new pan pc.\r\nLoaded correct driver and twain on OP2.\r\nErrors loading driver.\r\nCore Isolations is on.\r\nShut off and rebooted.\r\nInstalled and can see sensor in Sidexis.\r\nThey need to work with Patterson to configure.\r\n\r\nI can right click and take from twain.\r\nI turned Core  Isolation and rebooted.\r\n\r\nLeft him note for calling ES.\r\n\r\nTold him they can use Sidexis as imaging is they choose.\r\n\r\nLeft note with training videos and note:\r\nCall ES support to address errors and configure to Twain capture in Schick.\r\n\r\nIf you upgrade to ES 24.20 there is different driver and direct integration.\r\nYou can switch to Sidexis for full imaging if you choose, in this version.\r\n\r\nTo take images until you have ES fix.\r\nOpen ES and cancel CDR error.\r\nRight click image in template and select scanner.\r\n\r\nFunctional Test Successful / Follow Up:\r\nThey will work with ES\r\n\r\n__________________\r\n\r\nNote\r\n07/08/2025          11:07:27            Rebecca Buck (RBUCK)\r\n\r\n__  Further Action __\r\n------FURTHER ACTION-------  07/08/2025 10:55:41 AM (Dentsply Sirona Charlotte Time)\r\n\r\nCallers Full Name: Anna Lomas\r\nCallers Phone Number: 832-745-2965\r\nCallers Role: OM\r\n\r\nBilling Previously Accepted: YES\r\nPrevious Billed ticket # 1224165\r\n\r\nWarranty: No\r\nDealer on-site: No\r\nBillable: Yes\r\nBilling Accepted:  Yes\r\nBilling Approved By:  Dr Alethea Kypriotakis\r\n90 Day Expiration Date: 08/06/2025\r\n\r\nFurther Action Issue / Request:\r\nMigration done over the weekend.\r\nIT did not contact us.\r\nNot connected to DB.\r\nTried to call office.\r\nAnna not on site.\r\n\r\nSarah is IT.\r\n\r\nTroubleshooting Details:\r\n\r\nFunctional Test Successful / Follow Up:\r\n\r\n__________________\r\n\r\n\r\nLog\r\n07/07/2025          15:42:10            David Mottley (DMOTTLEY)\r\nNote\r\n07/07/2025          15:42:10            David Mottley (DMOTTLEY)\r\n\r\n__  Further Action __\r\n\r\nDetails: Inquiry\r\n\r\n\r\nCustomer called to check if IT has called yet.\r\n???\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nFollow Up:\r\n\r\n__________________\r\n\r\n\r\nSolution Description\r\n06/16/2025          10:12:06            Jean Lagraba (DIUQY284)\r\n\r\nSolution Description:\r\nIT is planning on calling back to replace RCU and other workstations . Doctor on site told me they plan on replacing all the workstaions as well.\r\n\r\n\r\nFunctional Test Successful / Follow Up:\r\n___________\r\n\r\n__________________\r\n\r\nSolution Description\r\n16.07.2025          23:09:45            Robert Jean (RJEAN)\r\n\r\nSolution Description: Logged in\r\nre started intra oral sensor service, now working, took test images fine\r\n\r\n\r\nFunctional (Yes/No): YES\r\n\r\n__________________\r\n\r\nLog\r\n16.07.2025          23:09:45            Robert Jean (RJEAN)\r\nNote\r\n16.07.2025          23:09:45            Robert Jean (RJEAN)\r\n\r\n__ Initial ticket creation __\r\n\r\n__________________",
