      "notes_text": "Note\r\n17.07.2025          18:54:46            Jen Brown (TRJJB112)\r\n\r\nThis issue has been troubleshooted and was determined to be related to software or connectivity related within the office and is considered routine servicing.  These requests are monitored for trend monthly at the Product Surveillance Committee (PSC) meeting.\r\n\r\nPlease close ticket.\r\n\r\n__________________\r\n\r\n\r\nSolution Description\r\n17.07.2025          00:22:07            Rebecca Buck (RBUCK)\r\n\r\ninstalled new driver after removing old.\r\n__________________\r\nProblem Description\r\n17.07.2025          00:21:48            Rebecca Buck (RBUCK)\r\n\r\nNew sensor install\r\n--------INITIAL LOG-------- 07/16/2025 6:07:17 PM (Dentsply Sirona Charlotte Time)\r\n\r\nWarranty:yes\r\nDealer on-site:no\r\nBillable:no\r\nRemote Access:yes\r\nSidexis Version:none\r\n\r\nPractice Management: ClearDent\r\nWorkstation(s): OP4\r\nScout Check:\r\n\r\nFirmware: 1.4.107 to 1.5.141\r\nPlug-in Version: 3.2\r\n\r\nTroubleshooting Details:\r\nRegistered sensor and did session.\r\nRemoved 5.16 driver and downloaded and installed 3.2 driver.\r\nShut off power management on usb ports.\r\nUpdated Firmware.\r\nGave part number for Sidexis if needed for twain.\r\nI do not see twain installed now.\r\n\r\nTested and gave err0r.attached.\r\nI renamed the Schick technology folder in program data and they will talk with Cleardent.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nFunctional Test Successful / Follow Up:\r\n\r\n__________________\r\n\r\nLog\r\n17.07.2025          00:10:11            Rebecca Buck (RBUCK)\r\nNote\r\n17.07.2025          00:10:11            Rebecca Buck (RBUCK)\r\n\r\n__ Initial ticket creation __\r\n\r\n__________________",
