      "support_hub": "US",
      "description_text": "does not read",
      "notes_text": "Note\r\n18.07.2025          14:17:26            Jen Brown (TRJJB112)\r\n\r\nThis issue has been troubleshooted and it was determined that a part of the system must be replaced.\r\nReplacement part has been recommended.  Complaints are monitored for trend monthly for the Product Surveillance Committee (PSC) meeting.\r\n\r\nPlease close complaint upon appropriate resolution for the customer.\r\n\r\n__________________\r\n\r\nProblem Description\r\n17.07.2025          15:49:18            Jeffrey Mandia (JMANDIA)\r\n\r\n\r\nXIOS AE with USB remote is not supported, and also NOT for sale in USA. This is for Europe, and Canada only. Replacements, orders, and warranty comes from Bensheim, Germany technical support only. If this is a USA 3.0 USB remote, we still cannot support this while XIOS AE is in use. Thank you.\r\nThis is not approved for RMA.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nIssue Reported: does not read\r\n\r\nEquipment Type and Model: 33 3.0\r\n\r\nSerial Number: 2023833\r\n\r\nAcquisition Software & Version: XVC\r\n\r\nIssue\r\n in One or All Rooms: all\r\n\r\nOther Sensors work with working Remotes in Room(s) with Issue: sensors work with other rmeote.\r\n\r\nPC Name:\r\n\r\n\r\nSchick Driver Version (Programs and features): 1.1.333.11055\r\n\r\nRemote FW/FPGA Version: doesnt read Sensor FW Version:  _____\r\n\r\nIf Re\r\nmote Issue:\r\n\r\n2.0 or 3.0: Tried Different USB Cable/USB Port/Bypassed USB hubs/Extenders: yes\r\n\r\n3.0 Remote: Tried on a 3.0 AND 2.0 USB\r\n port/cable clip connected: doesnt have clip\r\n\r\nAdditional Troubleshooting Steps/Notes: adivsed of backorder and gave part number for\r\ncable clips.\r\n\r\nPART PTC PROCESSING RMA FOR:3.0\r\n\r\n\r\n+++\r\n+++\r\n\r\n__________________\r\nCustomer Note\r\n17.07.2025          15:45:54            Jeffrey Mandia (JMANDIA)\r\n\r\nXIOS AE is not supported in USA. It is not approved by FDA. Support for any XIOS branded hardware is also from Bensheim, Germany DS tech support department. Thank you.\r\n__________________\r\n\r\n\r\nSolution Description\r\n17.07.2025          15:26:13            Talia Nastacio (TNASTACIO)\r\n\r\nDerrick Lustig Solution Description:\r\nPART PTC PROCESSING RMA FOR:3.0\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n__________________\r\nCustomer Note\r\n17.07.2025          14:59:04             CPIC_SIMO (CPIC_SIMO)\r\n\r\n Issue Reported: does not read\r\n\r\nEquipment Type and Model: 33 3.0\r\n\r\nSerial Number: 2023833\r\n\r\nAcquisition Software & Version: XVC\r\n\r\nIssue\r\n in One or All Rooms: all\r\n\r\nOther Sensors work with working Remotes in Room(s) with Issue: sensors work with other rmeote.\r\n\r\nPC Name:\r\n\r\n\r\nSchick Driver Version (Programs and features): 1.1.333.11055\r\n\r\nRemote FW/FPGA Version: doesnt read Sensor FW Version:  _____\r\n\r\nIf Re\r\nmote Issue:\r\n\r\n2.0 or 3.0: Tried Different USB Cable/USB Port/Bypassed USB hubs/Extenders: yes\r\n\r\n3.0 Remote: Tried on a 3.0 AND 2.0 USB\r\n port/cable clip connected: doesnt have clip\r\n\r\nAdditional Troubleshooting Steps/Notes: adivsed of backorder and gave part number for\r\ncable clips.\r\n\r\nPART PTC PROCESSING RMA FOR:3.0\r\n\r\n\r\n+++\r\n+++\r\n\r\n__________________\r\n\r\n\r\nLog\r\n17.07.2025          14:59:03             CPIC_SIMO (CPIC_SIMO)",
