      "notes_text": "Note\r\n18.07.2025          14:35:38            Jen Brown (TRJJB112)\r\n\r\nThis issue has been troubleshooted and was determined to be related to software or connectivity related within the office and is considered routine servicing.  These requests are monitored for trend monthly at the Product Surveillance Committee (PSC) meeting.\r\n\r\nPlease close ticket.\r\n\r\n__________________\r\n\r\nProblem Description\r\n17.07.2025          22:45:26            Rodolfo Alvarado (DIXJN758)\r\n\r\n--------INITIAL LOG-------- 07/17/2025 3:31:47 PM (Dentsply Sirona Charlotte Time)\r\n\r\nWarranty: YES\r\nDealer on-site: YES\r\nBillable: No\r\nDetails:\r\n\r\nFollow Up:\r\n\r\nDealer / Tech name: Scott Griffith  PD - 8645616111\r\nPractice:\r\nCIM ID:\r\nPhone #: 8647153200\r\nEmail:\r\nTicket #: 8001263265\r\nWarranty: YES\r\nCustomer Agreed to Charges: not billable. Dealer tech on site\r\nTV: 1303176850 p: yw3ufcfm (GNS-HYG-1)\r\nTV: 963248707 p: 3v25k5ak (GNS-HYG-2)\r\nTV: 1303116826 p: 715vddsx (GNS-HYG-3)\r\nIssue:\r\n- SCHICK33wAEUSB  Underexposed Exposures\r\n- Sidexis 4.3.1 present but not in use for IO\r\n- Progeny Preva\r\n- PMS is CareStack / SOTA\r\n\r\n__________________\r\n\r\nSolution Description\r\n17.07.2025          22:45:26            Rodolfo Alvarado (DIXJN758)\r\n\r\nSolution:\r\n- shared dsgo.to/schick\r\n- pointed to technique factor guideline\r\n- instructed to follow the table\r\n- 60Kv\r\n- connected to GNS-HYG-1\r\n- found IOSS3.2, USB AE driver and CDRTwain Driver\r\n- uninstalled conflicting drivers\r\n- installed all missing prereqs\r\n- rebooted workstation\r\n- reinstalled IOSS3.2\r\n- SN 25042243\r\n- USB Interface on FW1.4.107\r\n- disconnected sensor to upgrade USB interface\r\n- updated FW to 1.5.140\r\n- test shot with CareStack. success\r\n- 60KV 7mA 0.080s\r\n- adjusted settings to conform to technique factor manual\r\n- 65kV 7mA 0.080s\r\n- test shot with new settings. Success\r\n- connected to GNS-HYG-2\r\n- refreshed prereqs\r\n- removed USB AE drivers\r\n- rebooted workstation\r\n- installed IOSS3.2\r\n- Sitwain previously installed\r\n- test shot with CareStack. Success\r\n-  connected GNS-HYG-3\r\n- refreshed prereqs\r\n- removed USB AE drivers\r\n- rebooted workstation\r\n- installed IOSS3.2\r\n- Sitwain previously installed\r\n- test shot with CareStack. Success\r\n- shared ticket number\r\n\r\n__________________\r\n\r\nLog\r\n17.07.2025          21:30:29            Rodolfo Alvarado (DIXJN758)\r\nNote\r\n17.07.2025          21:30:29            Rodolfo Alvarado (DIXJN758)\r\n\r\n__ Initial ticket creation __\r\n\r\n__________________",
