      "notes_text": "Note\r\n05.08.2025          15:01:22            Armando Santacruz (ASANTACRUZ)\r\n\r\n__  Further Action __\r\nclosing ticket per J. Brown\r\n__________________\r\n\r\nNote\r\n05.08.2025          14:06:58            Jen Brown (TRJJB112)\r\n\r\nThis issue has been troubleshooted and it was determined that a part of the system must be replaced.\r\nReplacement part has been recommended.  Complaints are monitored for trend monthly for the Product Surveillance Committee (PSC) meeting.\r\n\r\nPlease close complaint upon appropriate resolution for the customer.\r\n\r\n__________________\r\n\r\nNote\r\n24.07.2025          23:38:04            Robert Jean (RJEAN)\r\n\r\n__  Further Action __\r\n------FURTHER ACTION-------  07/24/2025 3:47:15 PM (Dentsply Sirona Charlotte Time)\r\n\r\nCallers Full Name: Tom Smith\r\nCallers Phone Number:\r\nCallers Role: Patterson Tech\r\n\r\nProblem Description: Sensor not working.\r\n\r\nTroubleshooting Description:  Logged in on Op, sensor was in panic mode\r\nSolution Description:\r\n\r\nable to capture but hangs at about 4 captures  2027028--\r\n1.5.121 to 1.5.140\r\nHangs randomly in any treatment room with any sensor\r\n\r\nnew remote 2026015--same PC & sensor hangs after second exposure\r\nrebooted, disabled power management\r\nreprovisioned S4 client\r\n\r\n2025-07-24 13:51:59,725 Velocity.VelocityDevice.VelocityDevice                       [3 ] ERROR - Error reading image data, no image returned from USB device!\r\n2025-07-24 13:51:59,725 Velocity.VelocityHost.VelocityUsbDevice                      [46] DEBUG - SendMessageAndReadResponse (32) - Request Command 0x9 and Param 0x4\r\n2025-07-24 13:51:59,725 WebApiService.Services.AcquisitionManager+AcquisitionSession [3 ] ERROR - Error reading image data.\r\n2025-07-24 13:51:59,725 WebApiService.Services.AcquisitionManager+AcquisitionSession [3 ] DEBUG - GetCurrentAcquisitionStatus - State: Error, ExposureReady: False\r\n2025-07-24 13:51:59,725 WebApiService.Services.AcquisitionManager+AcquisitionSession [3 ] INFO  - Sending out status event Error to 1 clients\r\n2025-07-24 13:51:59,725 WebApiService.Services.AcquisitionManager+AcquisitionSession [3 ] INFO  - Processing Acquisition State Machine - State: Error, ImageStatus: NotReady\r\n2025-07-24 13:51:59,725 WebApiService.Services.AcquisitionManager+AcquisitionSession [3 ] ERROR - Session is in error state.\r\n2025-07-24 13:51:59,725 WebApiService.Services.AcquisitionManager+AcquisitionSession [3 ] INFO  - Acquisition state is unchanged, sending out status to clients in case other properties have changed\r\n2025-07-24 13:51:59,725 WebApiService.Services.AcquisitionManager+AcquisitionSession [3 ] DEBUG - GetCurrentAcquisitionStatus - State: Error, ExposureReady: False\r\n2025-07-24 13:51:59,725 WebApiService.Services.AcquisitionManager+AcquisitionSession [3 ] INFO  - Sending out status event Error to 1 clients\r\n2025-07-24 13:51:59,877 WebApiService.Helpers.SidexisApiHelperV4                     [42] DEBUG - Successfully uploaded image. Media Guid: 545ab587-8d6e-49bf-a60d-483d5aabc109\r\n2025-07-24 13:51:59,877 WebApiService.Helpers.SidexisApiHelperV4                     [42] ERROR - Sidexis API POST call failed with status: OK\r\n\r\n\r\ntried sensor 25055562--will lock up regardless of template chosen\r\n\r\n24024061 same behavior wiped Sidexis and plugin. cant get more than 3 shots\r\n\r\nwill replace 1 remote and go from there. He will fill out site survey to upgrade them to 4.4\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nFunctional (Yes/No):\r\n\r\n__________________\r\n\r\nNote\r\n24.07.2025          21:08:42            Talia Nastacio (TNASTACIO)\r\n\r\n__  Further Action __\r\n------FURTHER ACTION-------  07/24/2025 2:59:53 PM (Dentsply Sirona Charlotte Time)\r\n\r\nCallers Full Name: Donovan Huhner\r\nCallers Phone Number: 206-510-9659\r\nCallers Role: Patterson Tech\r\n\r\nWarranty Status: unknown\r\nBilling Previously Accepted:  N/A\r\n\r\nProblem Description:\r\nTech uninstalled the update that was installed previously on the server\r\nThen on workstation was working, he took about 10 exposures back to back, and then it stopped working\r\ncurrently all workstations are having issues: they can take 2 exposures and then cannot capture any other images\r\n\r\nTroubleshooting Description:\r\nConnected to ROOM1 and immediately found Core Isolation enabled -- cannot disable with the admin credentials he was provided\r\ninformed him we cannot further troubleshoot until that is disabled admin credentials dont allow him to log into this PC as admin user\r\nproceeded to workstations and they have the same issue as above\r\n\r\n\r\nSolution Description:\r\nhe will work with IT to have core isolation disabled and call us back\r\nalso advised to check firmware of USB to confirm they are updated\r\n\r\nFunctional (Yes/No): No\r\n\r\n__________________\r\n\r\nCustomer Note\r\n18.07.2025          23:49:21            Seth Woodward (SWOODWARD)\r\n\r\nok, not able to roll back update, if you can get back out to their office for further troubleshooting give us a call\r\n__________________\r\n\r\nCustomer Note\r\n17.07.2025          23:48:58             CPIC_SIMO (CPIC_SIMO)\r\n\r\nthey say they cant roll back the windows update, main user says their computers wont work if they do.\r\n__________________\r\n\r\nCustomer Note\r\n17.07.2025          23:44:58             CPIC_SIMO (CPIC_SIMO)\r\n\r\nthe issue didnt immediately effect all the OPs after the Critical updates to the server. it happened over a period of weeks\r\n__________________\r\n\r\n\r\nSolution Description\r\n17.07.2025          22:57:49            Seth Woodward (SWOODWARD)\r\n\r\n--------INITIAL LOG-------- 07/17/2025 3:32:22 PM (Dentsply Sirona Charlotte Time)\r\n\r\nWarranty: Yes\r\nDealer on-site: Yes\r\nBillable: No\r\nBilling Accepted:\r\nBilling Approved By:\r\n90 Day Expiration Date: 10/15/2025\r\n\r\nRemote Access: Yes\r\nSidexis Version: 4.3.1\r\nServer Location: SERVER\r\nPDATA Remote Location:\r\nRCU Location (If Applicable):\r\nPractice Management:\r\nWorkstation(s):\r\nScout Check:\r\n\r\nFirmware: 1.5.121\r\nPlug-in Version:\r\nExposure Count:\r\nUnit IP Address:\r\n\r\nTroubleshooting Description: logged on to ROOM1\r\nconfirmed issue - we couldnt complete 4 bitewing images without having to reconnect the sensor\r\ninstalled C++ 2008 and 2012 that were missing\r\nuninstalled and reinstalled sidexis 4 sensor plugin 2.2\r\nstill same issue - and its happening in all workstation - each workstation has its own interface module\r\nlogged on to SERVER\r\nrestarted the sidexis service\r\nstill same issue\r\n\r\noffice stated the issue started happening after they ran windows updates on their SERVER\r\n\r\nsince this is happening on all workstations i would recommend they start with rolling back the recent updates to see if that fixes the issue\r\n\r\n\r\n__________________\r\nNote\r\n17.07.2025          21:34:34            Seth Woodward (SWOODWARD)\r\n\r\n__ Initial ticket creation __\r\n\r\n__________________\r\n\r\nProblem Description\r\n17.07.2025          21:34:33            Seth Woodward (SWOODWARD)\r\n\r\ndurring a template or series of exposures they loose connection to the sensor and have to reconnect it\r\n__________________\r\n\r\nLog\r\n17.07.2025          21:34:33            Seth Woodward (SWOODWARD)",
