      "notes_text": "Note\r\n31.07.2025          21:50:19            Benjamin Magalhaes (BMAGALHAES)\r\n\r\n__  Further Action __\r\n------FURTHER ACTION-------  07/31/2025 3:35:43 PM (Dentsply Sirona Charlotte Time)\r\n\r\nCallers Full Name: Dawn Wirth\r\nCallers Phone Number: 631-682-5186\r\nCallers Role: ?\r\n\r\nWarranty Status: initial Ticket says yes so continuing as in warranty\r\n\r\nr\r\nProblem Description:  Wants to double check curve with sensor\r\n\r\nTroubleshooting Description:\r\n\r\nThey said sensor works fine.\r\n\r\nThey said sensor works for a while then after a few hours it wont work and a reboot allows it to work again...\r\n\r\nI showed them the USB power management and disabled it. Explained that windows will try to save power and disable the sensor which can cause what they are experiencing.\r\n\r\nHe then started to complain saying Why do we have to disable stuff to get this to work along those lines.\r\n\r\nI explained to him that we have no control over windows shutting down the sensor....\r\n\r\nTried to explain to him this is a windows feature typically on by default and disabling it helps the sensor work properly....\r\n\r\nHe also mentioned under exposed images.... Explained the xray technique factor and gave them the document...\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nSolution Description:\r\n\r\n\r\nFunctional (Yes/No):\r\n\r\n__________________\r\n\r\nNote\r\n28.07.2025          21:13:16            Jerome Miller (JMILLER1)\r\n\r\n__  Further Action __\r\n------FURTHER ACTION-------  07/28/2025 2:20:45 PM (Dentsply Sirona Charlotte Time)\r\n\r\nCallers Full Name: Dawn Wirth\r\nCallers Phone Number:\r\nCallers Role: Staff\r\n\r\nWarranty Status:no\r\nBilling Previously Accepted: Un sure\r\n\r\nProblem Description:\r\n\r\nTroubleshooting Description:\r\n\r\n\r\nSolution Description:Office installed new pcs connected to Operatory1\r\nuninstalled the old driver  and reinstalled the new\r\nthen set up in curve.\r\n\r\n\r\nFunctional (Yes/No):\r\n\r\n__________________\r\n\r\nNote\r\n18.07.2025          14:38:19            Jen Brown (TRJJB112)\r\n\r\nThis issue has been troubleshooted and was determined to be related to software or connectivity related within the office and is considered routine servicing.  These requests are monitored for trend monthly at the Product Surveillance Committee (PSC) meeting.\r\n\r\nPlease close ticket.\r\n\r\n__________________\r\n\r\nProblem Description\r\n17.07.2025          22:51:21            Randall Daniels (DIYWJ409)\r\n\r\n--------INITIAL LOG-------- 07/17/2025 4:12:08 PM (Dentsply Sirona Charlotte Time)\r\nWarranty: Warranty\r\nDealer on-site:  No\r\nBillable:  Not Billable-Warranty\r\nBilling Accepted:  NA\r\nBilling Approved By: NA\r\n90 Day Expiration Date: 10/15/2025\r\n\r\nRemote Access: Opp7\r\nSidexis Version: None\r\n\r\nProblem Description:\r\nSchick sensor doenst work well in Curve\r\n\r\nTroubleshooting Description:\r\nTV connection\r\nmultiple drivers installed\r\n\r\n\r\n__________________\r\n\r\nSolution Description\r\n17.07.2025          22:13:41            Randall Daniels (DIYWJ409)\r\n\r\n--------INITIAL LOG-------- 07/17/2025 4:13:21 PM (Dentsply Sirona Charlotte Time)\r\n\r\nSolution Description:\r\nremoved duplicate drivers\r\ninstalled IOSS 3.2\r\n\r\nFunctional Test Successful / Follow Up:\r\n__________________\r\n\r\nLog\r\n17.07.2025          22:13:41            Randall Daniels (DIYWJ409)\r\nNote\r\n17.07.2025          22:13:41            Randall Daniels (DIYWJ409)\r\n\r\n__ Initial ticket creation __\r\n\r\n__________________",
