      "notes_text": "Note\r\n18.07.2025          14:39:34            Jen Brown (TRJJB112)\r\n\r\nThis issue has been troubleshooted and it was determined that a part of the system must be replaced.\r\nReplacement part has been recommended.  Complaints are monitored for trend monthly for the Product Surveillance Committee (PSC) meeting.\r\n\r\nPlease close complaint upon appropriate resolution for the customer.\r\n\r\n__________________\r\n\r\nProblem Description\r\n17.07.2025          23:32:48            Seth Woodward (SWOODWARD)\r\n\r\ninterface module not powering on\r\n__________________\r\n\r\nSolution Description\r\n17.07.2025          23:32:48            Seth Woodward (SWOODWARD)\r\n\r\n--------INITIAL LOG-------- 07/17/2025 5:30:09 PM (Dentsply Sirona Charlotte Time)\r\n\r\nWarranty: No\r\nDealer on-site: No\r\nBillable: No - inquiry only\r\nBilling Accepted:  No\r\nDetails: Inquiry\r\n\r\nFollow Up: recommend replacement interface module\r\nother interface modules are working on the same workstation and USB cable\r\n\r\n__________________\r\nNote\r\n17.07.2025          23:29:44            Seth Woodward (SWOODWARD)\r\n\r\n__ Initial ticket creation __\r\n\r\n__________________\r\n\r\n\r\nLog\r\n17.07.2025          23:29:43            Seth Woodward (SWOODWARD)",
