      "notes_text": "Note\r\n18.07.2025          00:27:47            Austin Stevens (ASTEVENS)\r\n\r\n__ Initial ticket creation __\r\n\r\n__________________\r\n\r\nProblem Description\r\n18.07.2025          00:27:46            Austin Stevens (ASTEVENS)\r\n\r\n--------INITIAL LOG-------- 07/17/2025 6:20:17 PM (Dentsply Sirona Charlotte Time)\r\n\r\nWarranty: No\r\nDealer on-site: No\r\nBillable: No (Inquiry)\r\nBilling Accepted:  No\r\nDetails: Inquiry\r\n\r\nFollow Up: Chris Berry the IT director called in on behalf of De La Cruz Dental looking for assistance with what driver to use for their Schick sensors.\r\n- -\r\nProvided the website for the IOSS driver download since theyre using Denticon / Apteryx XV Capture to take the x-rays.\r\nHe kept me on the phone in case troubleshooting would be required (and billing to be applied).\r\nChris installed the driver successfully, but ran into the Core Isolation problem.\r\nEmailed him the Core Isolation document, pointed him in the direction of where the setting is.\r\n- -\r\nHe disabled Core Isolation as part of the article, and then was able to connect and take an x-ray.\r\nThe serial number provided was for a XIOS sensor, however Im told across several practices they have Schick 33 sensors.\r\n- -\r\nSupport policy explained to Chris for all XIOS sensors explained. (Could result in no support depending on the issue).\r\n\r\n__________________\r\n\r\nSolution Description\r\n18.07.2025          00:27:46            Austin Stevens (ASTEVENS)\r\n\r\nSolution Description: Chris installed the drivers, and disabled core isolation successfully.\r\nTest x-ray taken in Denticon software.\r\nHe is aware of our paid support model.\r\n- -\r\nChris mentioned (casually) that hell be moving away from Schick (and Denticon) due to paid support models.\r\nNo dealer listed as they use Sodium Dental another dental retailer / distributer, he says they likely received this XIOS sensor as a replacement to their Schick sensor.\r\n\r\nFunctional (Yes/No): Yes\r\n\r\n\r\n__________________\r\n\r\nLog\r\n18.07.2025          00:27:46            Austin Stevens (ASTEVENS)",
