, performed the upgrade on 2 interfaces successfully.\r\nTested with sensor 25070048, sensor detected in Intraoral app but not blinking to acquire in Eaglesoft.\r\nTested this sensor 25070048, not detected.\r\nInstalled missing prereqs then rebooted workstation, sensor 25070047 is working and was able to take an exposure.\r\nSensor 25070048 still not detected, requested tech to replace the sensor cable, he states he can not get the screw out, it seems like its stripped (brand new sensor)\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n__________________\r\n\r\nSolution Description\r\n18.07.2025          16:53:13            Sebastian Cedeno (SCEDENO)\r\n\r\nSolution Description: recommended replacing the sensor part number 100008651\r\n\r\n\r\nFunctional (Yes/No): No.\r\n\r\n\r\n__________________\r\n\r\nLog\r\n18.07.2025          15:33:41            Sebastian Cedeno (SCEDENO)\r\nNote\r\n18.07.2025          15:33:41            Sebastian Cedeno (SCEDENO)\r\n\r\n__ Initial ticket creation __\r\n\r\n__________________",
