025          18:27:56             CPIC_SIMO (CPIC_SIMO)\r\n\r\nDetails: Issue Reported: Does not power on\r\n\r\nEquipment Type and Model: 3.0 remote\r\n\r\nSerial Number: 2042918\r\n\r\nAcquisition Software & Ver\r\nsion: Eaglesoft 24.00\r\n\r\nIssue in One or All Rooms: All\r\n\r\nOther Sensors work with working Remotes in Room(s) with Issue: Yes\r\n\r\nPC Name:\r\n\r\n\r\nSchick Driver Version (Programs and features): 1.1.3\r\n\r\nRemote FW/FPGA Version: N/A  Sensor FW Version:  N/A\r\n\r\nIf Remote Issue:\r\n\r\n2.0 o\r\nr 3.0: Tried Different USB Cable/USB Port/Bypassed USB hubs/Extenders: Yes\r\n\r\n3.0 Remote: Tried on a 3.0 AND 2.0 USB port/cable clip c\r\nonnected: Yes\r\n\r\nIf Sensor Issue, Replaced Elastomer:\r\n\r\nIf Sensor Issue, Tried Different Sensor Cable:\r\n\r\nIf no response to radiation, co\r\nnfirmed Xray Head Functional:\r\n\r\nAdditional Troubleshooting Steps/Notes: Remote would not appear in DM even without sensor attached. C\r\nould not check remote fw. Neither remote worked on one wks. I un/re the driver and one remote was detected. The faulty one was not.\r\n\r\n\r\nPART PTC PROCESSING RMA FOR:  AE INTERFACE\r\n\r\n+++\r\n+++\r\n\r\n__________________",
