lotte Time)\r\n\r\nWarranty: Yes\r\nDealer on-site: Yes\r\nBillable: No\r\nBilling Accepted:\r\nBilling Approved By:\r\n90 Day Expiration Date: 10/16/2025\r\n\r\nRemote Access: No\r\nSidexis Version:\r\nServer Location:\r\nPDATA Remote Location:\r\nRCU Location (If Applicable):\r\nPractice Management:\r\nWorkstation(s):\r\nScout Check:\r\n\r\nFirmware:\r\nPlug-in Version:\r\nExposure Count:\r\nUnit IP Address:\r\n\r\nTroubleshooting Description: out of the box he had no connection to the sensor\r\nhe replaced the sensor cable and elastomeric strip and now the sensor is working properly\r\nrecommend replacement sensor cable\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n__________________\r\n\r\nLog\r\n18.07.2025          19:43:12            Seth Woodward (SWOODWARD)\r\nNote\r\n18.07.2025          19:43:12            Seth Woodward (SWOODWARD)\r\n\r\n__ Initial ticket creation __\r\n\r\n__________________",
