      "description_text": "sensor not recognized",
      "notes_text": "Note\r\n25.07.2025          20:56:05            Randall Daniels (DIYWJ409)\r\n\r\n__  Further Action __\r\n------FURTHER ACTION-------  07/25/2025 2:54:47 PM (Dentsply Sirona Charlotte Time)\r\nCaller Full Name: Bruce Woods\r\nCaller Phone Number: 5595756377\r\nCaller Role: Dealer\r\n\r\nWarranty Status:Warranty\r\nBilling Previously Accepted: NA\r\nBilling Accepted: NA\r\nBilling Approved By: NA\r\n\r\nProblem Description:\r\nWants to get information for Sensor replacement\r\nTroubleshooting Description:\r\nNone\r\nSolution Description:\r\nProvided ticket information\r\nadded sensor into recommended parts\r\nrecommended parts:\r\nB1118051\r\n\r\n__________________\r\n\r\nNote\r\n21.07.2025          14:37:34            Jen Brown (TRJJB112)\r\n\r\nThis issue has been troubleshooted and it was determined that a part of the system must be replaced.\r\nReplacement part has been recommended.  Complaints are monitored for trend monthly for the Product Surveillance Committee (PSC) meeting.\r\n\r\nPlease close complaint upon appropriate resolution for the customer.\r\n\r\n__________________\r\n\r\nNote\r\n19.07.2025          00:48:27            Austin Stevens (ASTEVENS)\r\n\r\n__  Further Action __\r\n------FURTHER ACTION-------  07/18/2025 6:33:09 PM (Dentsply Sirona Charlotte Time)\r\n\r\nCallers Full Name: Maria Alverez\r\nCallers Phone Number: 559 471 9158\r\nCallers Role: Office staff\r\n\r\nWarranty Status: In warranty\r\nBilling Previously Accepted: NA\r\n\r\nDetails: Maria called back with Tommy at iDentSoft software on the line.\r\nTheyre trying to integrate the sensors but the legacy drivers are installed.\r\nRemoted back into LWCDENTAL and removed legacy drivers.\r\nInstalled Sidexis 4.4 (unlicensed), IOSS 3.2, and Sitwain.\r\n- -\r\nShe states the Size 1 sensor is not being detected again.\r\nIOSS only showing the USB interface and not the sensor.\r\nSize 2 sensor is recognized on both USB interfaces.\r\nHad Maria replace the sensor cable on the affected sensor and no change in connectivity.\r\nSensor cable, and elastomer were replaced and sensor is still not detected.\r\n- -\r\nRecommending replacement sensor here.\r\nTicket number provided to Maria if further assistance is required.\r\n\r\n__________________\r\n\r\nNote\r\n18.07.2025          23:30:01            Rebecca Buck (RBUCK)\r\n\r\n--------INITIAL LOG-------- 07/18/2025 5:29:31 PM (Dentsply Sirona Charlotte Time)\r\n\r\nWarranty: No\r\nDetails: Inquiry\r\n\r\nFollow Up:\r\nTransferred to Austin per caller request.\r\nFunctional Test Successful / Follow Up:\r\n\r\n__________________\r\n\r\nProblem Description\r\n18.07.2025          23:21:02            Austin Stevens (ASTEVENS)\r\n\r\n--------INITIAL LOG-------- 07/18/2025 5:17:52 PM (Dentsply Sirona Charlotte Time)\r\n\r\nWarranty: Yes (purchased 07/16/2025)\r\nDealer on-site: No\r\nBillable: No\r\nBilling Accepted: No\r\nDetails: Inquiry\r\n\r\nFollow Up: Maria called in because their size one sensor is not being detected in their software.\r\nRemoted into LWCDENTIST and opened AE USB Interface Utility (legacy drivers installed)\r\nSize 2 sensor recognized, Size 1 sensor not recognized on the same USB interface.\r\n- -\r\nWalked Maria through removing the cable, cleaning the contacts, and reattaching.\r\nStill not detected, had her grab an extra elastomeric strip and replace it from their starter kit.\r\nSensor now detected.\r\n- -\r\nShe needs to call their capture software company to initiate the bridge to use the Schick sensors.\r\n\r\n__________________\r\n\r\nSolution Description\r\n18.07.2025          23:21:02            Austin Stevens (ASTEVENS)\r\n\r\nSolution Description: Elastomeric strip replaced with spare.\r\n\r\n\r\nFunctional (Yes/No): Yes\r\n\r\n\r\n__________________\r\n\r\nLog\r\n18.07.2025          23:17:40            Austin Stevens (ASTEVENS)\r\nNote\r\n18.07.2025          23:17:40            Austin Stevens (ASTEVENS)\r\n\r\n__ Initial ticket creation __\r\n\r\n__________________",
