      "description_text": "wifi connection problems",
      "notes_text": "Customer Note\r\n30.07.2025          16:49:31            Gerhard Rauch (GERRAU)\r\n\r\nHello,\r\n\r\nanswer from Backoffice:\r\n\r\nPlease order with reference to this ticket number and the original order:\r\n\r\nFor Sidexis 4 > 4.31:\r\n6724723 Xios AE USB package\r\nand a variant, depending on your preference:\r\n6724772 Xios AE USB cable kit 90cm or\r\n6724780 Xios AE USB cable kit 180cm or\r\n6724798 Xios AE USB cable kit 270cm\r\n\r\nFor Sidexis <= Sidexis 4.3.1:\r\n6404656 Xios XG USB module\r\n6404235 Xios XG USB cable A/B 2m with ferrite\r\nand a variant, depending on your preference:\r\n6404169 XIOS XG USB cable kit 90cm\r\n6404177 XIOS XG USB cable kit 180 cm\r\n6404185 XIOS XG USB cable kit 270 cm\r\n\r\nAfter that, please submit a goodwill request - also with reference to this ticket number\r\nfor the WiFi module originally ordered\r\n\r\nYou will then receive a 100% goodwill payment equal to the value of the parts ordered above.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nBest regards,\r\n\r\nGerhard Rauch\r\n\r\nCustomer Care Center Image Systems\r\nDentsply Sirona\r\n\r\n\r\n__________________\r\n\r\nNote\r\n30.07.2025          16:49:30            Gerhard Rauch (GERRAU)\r\n\r\nBitte Antwort vom Backoffice beacht\r\n__________________\r\n\r\nNote\r\n29.07.2025          17:30:46            Jen Brown (TRJJB112)\r\n\r\nThis issue has been troubleshooted and it was determined that a part of the system must be replaced.\r\nReplacement part has been recommended.  Complaints are monitored for trend monthly for the Product Surveillance Committee (PSC) meeting.\r\n\r\nPlease close complaint upon appropriate resolution for the customer.\r\n\r\n__________________\r\n\r\n\r\nSolution Description\r\n28.07.2025          11:06:57            Gerhard Rauch (GERRAU)\r\n\r\nPlease refer to customer communication via Customer Notes\r\n__________________\r\nCustomer Note\r\n28.07.2025          11:06:57            Gerhard Rauch (GERRAU)\r\n\r\nDear Adam,\r\n\r\nthis is a case for order service, theres a exchange pack XIOS available. Please contact them...\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nBest regards,\r\n\r\nGerhard Rauch\r\n\r\nCustomer Care Center Image Systems\r\nDentsply Sirona\r\n\r\n\r\n__________________\r\n\r\nCustomer Note\r\n21.07.2025          12:55:10             CPIC_SIMO (CPIC_SIMO)\r\n\r\nDears,\r\n\r\nI am writing regarding issues with the operation of the Wifi module. The client is planning to purchase a Heliodent Plus and\r\n a new sensor for a second location.\r\n\r\nThe client is satisfied with the image quality however, there are increasing problems with fr\r\neezing, long waiting times for images, and general issues with Wifi connection quality. The problems have become serious enough that\r\n the client is considering a paid transition to a wired connection.\r\n\r\nTogether with the dealer, and in order to ensure the clients s\r\natisfaction and maintain their trust in our company, we would like to propose this client switching to a wired connection as a gestu\r\nre of goodwill.\r\n\r\nPlease let me know if this is possible and provide the part numbers if our request is accepted.\r\n\r\nXios XG serial num\r\nber: 71017086\r\nWifi module REF number: 6404482\r\nWifi module serial number: 41006870\r\nWifi module manufacture date: 03/2022\r\n\r\nRegards,\r\nAd\r\nam Witanowski\r\nDentsply Sirona Poland\r\n\r\n+++\r\n+++\r\n\r\n__________________\r\n\r\nProblem Description\r\n21.07.2025          12:55:09             CPIC_SIMO (CPIC_SIMO)\r\n\r\nDears,\r\n\r\nI am writing regarding issues with the operation of the Wifi module. The client is planning to purchase a Heliodent Plus and\r\n a new sensor for a second location.\r\n\r\nThe client is satisfied with the image quality however, there are increasing problems with fr\r\neezing, long waiting times for images, and general issues with Wifi connection quality. The problems have become serious enough that\r\n the client is considering a paid transition to a wired connection.\r\n\r\nTogether with the dealer, and in order to ensure the clients s\r\natisfaction and maintain their trust in our company, we would like to propose this client switching to a wired connection as a gestu\r\nre of goodwill.\r\n\r\nPlease let me know if this is possible and provide the part numbers if our request is accepted.\r\n\r\nXios XG serial num\r\nber: 71017086\r\nWifi module REF number: 6404482\r\nWifi module serial number: 41006870\r\nWifi module manufacture date: 03/2022\r\n\r\nRegards,\r\nAd\r\nam Witanowski\r\nDentsply Sirona Poland\r\n\r\n+++\r\n+++\r\n\r\n__________________\r\n\r\nLog\r\n21.07.2025          12:55:09             CPIC_SIMO (CPIC_SIMO)",
