      "solution_summary": "for the customer. __________________ ************************Safety Task ************************ Log 25.07.2025 12:58:12 Jen Brown (TRJJB112) ************************************************ Note 25.07.2025 12:58:12 Jen Brown (TRJJB112) Based on the ticket information, there is no injury to the patient or user. The image acquired contains a full previous image or a portion of previous and current image or a blank image which is identifiable. It is not possible for a dentist to provide treatment based on the image acquired and the dentist would need to retake another image to provide treatment. Therefore, there is no risk to the patient for unnecessary treatment and the risk of additional radiation exposure is assessed as part of the product risk management and there are no immediate or long-range consequences. This complaint is evaluated to be Not Reportable within USA and ROW. The issue is being evaluated under CAPA-2024-532. __________________ ************************************************ Note 24.07.2025 23:55:10 Rebecca Buck (RBUCK) __ Further Action __ ------FURTHER ACTION------- 07/24/2025 5:53:14 PM (Dentsply Sirona Charlotte Time) Callers Full Name: Jen Brown Callers Phone Number: e-mail Callers Role: DS QC Created safety ticket per request. No previous patient images reported or provided. Follow Up: __________________ Solution Description 23.07.2025 16:51:21 Rebecca Buck (RBUCK) Gave him part number for Sidexis 4.4 and IT will need to call and upgrade. __________________"
