d, also J5 powered hubs -- both caused more issues\r\n Had issues in every OP with powered hub -- removed those and now using PC connections which helped clean up the issues\r\n Have USB all by itself in back of PC -- we are moving to front port and testing again --\r\n Connection remains intermittent - can take 11 or 12 shots then it disconnects\r\n\r\n ***  USB interface box SN 2048808\r\n\r\n  Solution Description: Connection remains intermittent - can take 11 or 12 shots then it disconnects\r\n  Remains unresolved\r\n\r\n USB interface box SN 2048808\r\n\r\n     Functional (Yes/No): No - FAILS\r\n__________________\r\n\r\nProblem Description\r\n24.07.2025          00:19:40            John Morris (JMORRIS)\r\n\r\nHe is in the office and on two workstations the connection is intermittent.\r\n\r\n__________________\r\n\r\nSolution Description\r\n23.07.2025          22:10:15            Elhadji Seye (SELHADJI)\r\n\r\nI wanted to login and take a look but the room is busy and will be freed in 30 mn.\r\n__________________\r\n\r\nLog\r\n23.07.2025          22:08:27            Elhadji Seye (SELHADJI)\r\nNote\r\n23.07.2025          22:08:27            Elhadji Seye (SELHADJI)\r\n\r\n__ Initial ticket creation __\r\n\r\n__________________",
