since April, and there are several tickets related to this issue already.\r\n\r\n8001210875\r\n8001242831\r\n8001266508\r\n\r\nAnd there may be more.\r\nWe have been told to wait for CAPA 2024-532 to be finished in July, but we are still waiting for the solution.\r\n\r\nKind regards\r\n\r\nKim Mikkelsen\r\nTechnical Service Manager Nordics\r\n\r\n\r\nFra: Mescher, Jan <Jan.Mescher@dentsplysirona.com>\r\nSendt: 16. september 2025 16:17\r\nTil: Sandrini, Kristian <Kristian.Sandrini@dentsplysirona.com> Kirsch, Janina <Janina.Kirsch@dentsplysirona.com> Csekes, Attila <Attila.Csekes@dentsplysirona.com> Heist, Claus-Peter <Claus-Peter.Heist@dentsplysirona.com>\r\nCc: Mikkelsen, Kim <Kim.Mikkelsen@dentsplysirona.com> Odhner, Jens <Jens.Odhner@dentsplysirona.com> Thomsen, Henrik <Henrik.Thomsen@dentsplysirona.com> Schaeuffele, Dieter <Dieter.Schaeuffele@dentsplysirona.com>\r\nEmne: AW: Adverse Event Report (MIR) 6.6.2-2025-077486\r\n\r\nHi Kristian,\r\n\r\nI would suggest the following steps to ensure a smooth process:\r\n- Please create a ticket with the information below and attach all relevant documents.\r\n- @Heist, Claus-Peter please make sure that this ticket is directly forwarded to the Quality Team in York.\r\n- @Kirsch, Janina I would suggest that you proactively connect with the Quality Team to make them aware and ensure a timely handling of this request.\r\n\r\n\r\nDoes this work for everybody?\r\n\r\nBest,\r\nJan\r\n\r\nVon: Sandrini, Kristian <Kristian.Sandrini@dentsplysirona.com>\r\nGesendet: Dienstag, 16. September 2025 15:22\r\nAn: Kirsch, Janina <Janina.Kirsch@dentsplysirona.com> Mescher, Jan <Jan.Mescher@dentsplysirona.com> Csekes, Attila <Attila.Csekes@dentsplysirona.com>\r\nCc: Mikkelsen, Kim <Kim.Mikkelsen@dentsplysirona.com> Odhner, Jens <Jens.Odhner@dentsplysirona.com> Thomsen, Henrik <Henrik.Thomsen@dentsplysirona.com>\r\nBetreff: Adverse Event Report (MIR) 6.6.2-2025-077486\r\nPriorität: Hoch\r\n\r\nDear all\r\n\r\nNOTE: Short deadline\r\nThe case with wrong images on wrong patient (buffering images), white images and pixelated images has now been reported to the Swedish Medical Products Agency.\r\n\r\nThe Agency has requested an official report from us latest September 30th 2025. The report has to be uploaded here: Steg 1 av 5. Välj språk / Select language. Uppladdningstjänst för rapporter inom säkerhetsövervakning / E-service for upload of vigilance repor. Läkemedelsverket\r\n\r\nAll other communication through this email address: meddev.central@lakemedelsverket.se\r\n\r\nI have attached both the Swedish documents as well as the English AI translation.\r\nMay I trust you to handle this?\r\n\r\nKind regards,\r\n\r\nKristian\r\n\r\nFrom: Lindgren, Martin <Martin.Lindgren@dentsplysirona.com>\r\nSent: Tuesday, September 16, 2025 2:46 PM\r\nTo: Sandrini, Kristian <Kristian.Sandrini@dentsplysirona.com>\r\nCc: Sweden-Info <info.se@dentsplysirona.com>\r\nSubject: FW: Begäran om tillverkarrapport(MIR) 6.6.2-2025-077486\r\n\r\nTjena,\r\n\r\nHär kommer underlag från LMV.\r\n\r\n/Martin\r\n\r\nFrom: Sweden-Info <info.se@dentsplysirona.com>\r\nSent: den 16 september 2025 12:56\r\nTo: Lindgren, Martin <Martin.Lindgren@dentsplysirona.com>\r\nSubject: FW: Begäran om tillverkarrapport(MIR) 6.6.2-2025-077486\r\n\r\nHej,\r\nSkickar vidare till dig.\r\n\r\nTack!\r\n//E\r\n\r\nFrom: meddev.central@lakemedelsverket.se <meddev.central@lakemedelsverket.se>\r\nSent: den 16 september 2025 11:50\r\nTo: Sweden-Info <info.se@dentsplysirona.com>\r\nSubject: Begäran om tillverkarrapport(MIR) 6.6.2-2025-077486\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nDiarienummer: 6.6.2-2025-077486\r\nEr referens: 630615\r\nDatum: 2025-09-16\r\n\r\nVänligen se bifogat dokument från Läkemedelsverket.\r\n\r\nBifogad(e) fil(er):\r\nAnmälan om negativa händelser eller tillbud med medicintekniska produkter 1757945186678.pdf\r\nBegäran om tillverkarrapport (MIR).pdf\r\n\r\nPå Läkemedelsverkets vägnar\r\nLovisa Pärn Yngwe\r\n\r\n\r\nPostadress: Box 26, 751 03 Uppsala\r\nBesöksadress: Dag 