es), white images and pixelated images has now been reported to the Swedish Medical Products Agency.\r\n\r\n The Agency has requested an official report from us latest September 30th 2025. The report has to be uploaded here: Steg 1 av 5. Välj språk / Select language. Uppladdningstjänst för rapporter inom säkerhetsövervakning / E-service for upload of vigilance repor. Läkemedelsverket\r\n\r\n All other communication through this email address: meddev.central@lakemedelsverket.se\r\n\r\n I have attached both the Swedish documents as well as the English AI translation.\r\n May I trust you to handle this?\r\n\r\n Kind regards,\r\n\r\n Kristian\r\n\r\n From: Lindgren, Martin <Martin.Lindgren@dentsplysirona.com>\r\n Sent: Tuesday, September 16, 2025 2:46 PM\r\n To: Sandrini, Kristian <Kristian.Sandrini@dentsplysirona.com>\r\n Cc: Sweden-Info <info.se@dentsplysirona.com>\r\n Subject: FW: Begäran om tillverkarrapport(MIR) 6.6.2-2025-077486\r\n\r\n Tjena,\r\n\r\n Här kommer underlag från LMV.\r\n\r\n /Martin\r\n\r\n From: Sweden-Info <info.se@dentsplysirona.com>\r\n Sent: den 16 september 2025 12:56\r\n To: Lindgren, Martin <Martin.Lindgren@dentsplysirona.com>\r\n Subject: FW: Begäran om tillverkarrapport(MIR) 6.6.2-2025-077486\r\n\r\n Hej,\r\n Skickar vidare till dig.\r\n\r\n Tack!\r\n //E\r\n\r\n From: meddev.central@lakemedelsverket.se <meddev.central@lakemedelsverket.se>\r\n Sent: den 16 september 2025 11:50\r\n To: Sweden-Info <info.se@dentsplysirona.com>\r\n Subject: Begäran om tillverkarrapport(MIR) 6.6.2-2025-077486\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n Diarienummer: 6.6.2-2025-077486\r\n Er referens: 630615\r\n Datum: 2025-09-16\r\n\r\n Vänligen se bifogat dokument från Läkemedelsverket.\r\n\r\n Bifogad(e) fil(er):\r\n Anmälan om negativa händelser eller tillbud med medicintekniska produkter 1757945186678.pdf\r\n Begäran om tillverkarrapport (MIR).pdf\r\n\r\n På Läkemedelsverkets vägnar\r\n Lovisa Pärn Yngwe\r\n\r\n\r\n Postadress: Box 26, 751 03 Uppsala\r\n Besöksadress: Dag Hammarskjölds väg 42\r\n Växel 018 - 17 46 00\r\n E-post: meddev.central@lakemedelsverket.se\r\n www.lakemedelsverket.se\r\n Så här behandlar Läkemedelsverket personuppgifter\r\n\r\n\r\n STID#1758016173000A333049892#\r\n\r\n __________________\r\n\r\n************************************************\r\n\r\nCustomer Note\r\n09/16/2025          11:03:08             CPIC_SIMO (CPIC_SIMO)\r\n\r\nDEADLINE 30.09.2025 - Please see email conversation below\r\n\r\nThis issue is also related to tickets:\r\n8001210875\r\n8001242831\r\n8001266508\r\n\r\n\r\n...and there may be more.\r\nWe have been told to wait for CAPA 2024-532 to be finished in July, but we are still waiting for the solut\r\nion.\r\n\r\nExtract from my email today on which Jan Mescher asked me to create this ticket.\r\nPlease also see the attached email received t\r\noday from our dealer Unident on similar topic related to our largest customer in Sweden (LT9), covering approx. 45% of the public de\r\nntistry market and who has more than 2.000 sensors in use in their clinics. With this specific customer a 15 year contract is on ris\r\nk(!)\r\n\r\nDear all\r\n\r\nNOTE: Short deadline\r\nThe case with wrong images on wrong patient (buffering images), white images and pixelated imag\r\nes has now been reported to the Swedish Medical Products Agency.\r\n\r\nThe Agency has requested an official report from us latest Septemb\r\ner 30th 2025. The report has to be uploaded here: https://e-service.lakemedelsverket.se/formservice/formDownload?serviceName=multi_s\r\nervice_lakemedelsverketservice_name=mt_ot_rappor\r\ntering_tillverkare&skip.login=yes\r\n\r\nAll other communication through this email address: meddev.central@lakemedelsverket.se\r\n\r\nI have at\r\ntached both the Swedish documents as well as the English AI translation.\r\nMay I trust you to handle this?\r\n\r\nKind regards,\r\n\r\nKristian\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n+++\r\n+++\r\n\r\n__________________\r\n\r\nProblem Description\r\n09/16/2025          11:03:06             