      "description_text": "driver install help / sensor 33 3.0 usb",
      "notes_text": "Note\r\n28.07.2025          21:25:39            Taylor Bledsoe (DIIDF904)\r\n\r\n__  Further Action __\r\n------FURTHER ACTION-------  07/28/2025 2:07:15 PM (Dentsply Sirona Charlotte Time)\r\n\r\nCallers Full Name: Doug Nenniger\r\nCallers Phone Number: 3865471398\r\nCallers Role: Dealer Tech\r\n\r\nWarranty Status: YES\r\n\r\nProblem Description:\r\nPractice updating PCs and OS, needed sidexis 4.3.1 installed for TWAIN bridging to Patterson Imaging\r\n\r\nSolution Description:\r\nLogged into SERVER, installed SQL 2022, SSMS 20, Sidexis 4.3.1 server.\r\n\r\nhelped set up on a few workstations that needed prereqs, old random Sidexis XG clients and old Schick drivers removed, etc. and we got them configured and tested to use Sidexis 4.3.1 + Sensor plugin 2.2 + SiTWAIN.\r\n\r\nFunctional (Yes/No):\r\nYes, Patterson Imaging support needs to configure their Acquire button defaults and potentially add a plugin or regkey to get it to work the way they want, but the sirona side of things is verified functional on all the workstations I was on.\r\n\r\n__________________\r\n\r\nNote\r\n28.07.2025          17:49:34            Jen Brown (TRJJB112)\r\n\r\nThis issue has been troubleshooted and was determined to be related to software or connectivity related within the office and is considered routine servicing.  These requests are monitored for trend monthly at the Product Surveillance Committee (PSC) meeting.\r\n\r\nPlease close ticket.\r\n\r\n__________________\r\n\r\nNote\r\n24.07.2025          21:27:36            Austin Stevens (ASTEVENS)\r\n\r\n__  Further Action __\r\n------FURTHER ACTION-------  07/24/2025 3:17:41 PM (Dentsply Sirona Charlotte Time)\r\n\r\nCallers Full Name: Doug Nenninger\r\nCallers Phone Number: 386 547 1398\r\nCallers Role: Dealer Tech\r\n\r\nWarranty Status: Yes\r\nBilling Previously Accepted: No\r\n\r\nProblem Description: Doug called in requesting help with how to install IOSS 3.2 as previously recommended.\r\n\r\nTroubleshooting Description: I remoted into their PC and see Patterson Imaging is installed.\r\nI explained well need Sidexis 4.4, and SiTwain to be installed alongside IOSS since Patterson Imaging (this version) doesnt have direct integration with IOSS.\r\n- -\r\nTrying to get the plug-in installed however UAC is preventing us.\r\nDr is looking for their password however he cannot find it, and IT is not available.\r\nDoug will schedule this another day with the doctor and call us back with assistance in installing Sidexis 4.4 on their server.\r\n\r\nSolution Description: Doug will call back when ready to install Sidexis 4.4 on their server, and install clients, IOSS, and Sitwain.\r\n\r\n\r\nFunctional (Yes/No): No\r\n\r\n__________________\r\n\r\nProblem Description\r\n24.07.2025          20:28:56            Keenan Jordan (KJORDAN)\r\n\r\n--------INITIAL LOG-------- 07/24/2025 1:53:30 PM (Dentsply Sirona Charlotte Time)\r\n\r\nWarranty: Yes\r\nDealer on-site: Yes\r\nBillable:\r\nBilling Accepted:\r\nBilling Approved By:\r\n90 Day Expiration Date: 10/22/2025\r\n\r\nDriver Install Help / Sensor 33, 3.0 USB\r\n\r\n\r\n__________________\r\n\r\nSolution Description\r\n24.07.2025          20:28:56            Keenan Jordan (KJORDAN)\r\n\r\nRemote Access: TV\r\nSidexis Version: N/A\r\nServer Location: N/A\r\nPDATA Remote Location:\r\nRCU Location (If Applicable):\r\nPractice Management: Eagle Soft\r\nWorkstation(s): OP1\r\nScout Check:\r\n\r\nFirmware:\r\nPlug-in Version: 3.2 Sensor Driver\r\nExposure Count:\r\nUnit IP Address:\r\n\r\nTroubleshooting Details:\r\n\r\nDealer tech needs help installing the 3.0 driver software.\r\n\r\nFunctional Test Successful / Follow Up:\r\n\r\nDealer tech will continue to install the driver on the other workstations.\r\n\r\n__________________\r\n\r\nLog\r\n24.07.2025          20:28:56            Keenan Jordan (KJORDAN)\r\nNote\r\n24.07.2025          20:28:56            Keenan Jordan (KJORDAN)\r\n\r\n__ Initial ticket creation __\r\n\r\n_______________