      "notes_text": "Note\r\n05.08.2025          20:14:25            Keenan Jordan (KJORDAN)\r\n\r\n__  Further Action __\r\n------FURTHER ACTION-------  08/05/2025 2:08:26 PM (Dentsply Sirona Charlotte Time)\r\n\r\nCallers Full Name: Armin Armesh\r\nCallers Phone Number: 6048427990\r\nCallers Role: Patterson Tech\r\n\r\nBilling Previously Accepted:\r\nBilling Accepted:\r\nBilling Approved By:\r\n\r\nFurther Action Issue / Request:\r\n\r\nThe Office needs a size 1 sensor.\r\n\r\nTroubleshooting Details:\r\n\r\nThe office size 1 sensor did not work, and they would like to replace it.\r\n\r\nSN: 24029142\r\n\r\nFunctional Test Successful / Follow Up:\r\n\r\n100008655 SCHICK33 S1 SENSOR/3.0 CABLE RMA KIT, 9FT\r\n\r\n__________________\r\n\r\nNote\r\n29.07.2025          23:42:36            Keenan Jordan (KJORDAN)\r\n\r\n__  Further Action __\r\nDoctor had existing Schick AE remote boxes and Schick 33 S2 sensor. He got a new Schick 33 S1 sensor almost 2 weeks ago that was shi\r\npped to him directly. He stated that since receiving it, the sensor was working intermittently and in the past few days it wasnt wo\r\nrking at all.\r\n\r\nI do not see anything in this text indicating you needed a size 0.\r\n\r\nCan you please provide the correct SN of the size 0 sensor please.\r\n\r\n100008657 SCHICK33 S0 SENSOR/3.0 CABLE RMA KIT, 6FT\r\n__________________\r\n\r\nCustomer Note\r\n28.07.2025          22:45:32             CPIC_SIMO (CPIC_SIMO)\r\n\r\nthe spare parts recommended is a size 0 kit but I need a size 1\r\n__________________\r\n\r\nNote\r\n28.07.2025          19:05:47            Jen Brown (TRJJB112)\r\n\r\nThis issue has been troubleshooted and it was determined that a part of the system must be replaced.\r\nReplacement part has been recommended.  Complaints are monitored for trend monthly for the Product Surveillance Committee (PSC) meeting.\r\n\r\nPlease close complaint upon appropriate resolution for the customer.\r\n\r\n__________________\r\n\r\n\r\nSolution Description\r\n28.07.2025          15:25:22            Keenan Jordan (KJORDAN)\r\n\r\n100008657 SCHICK33 S0 SENSOR/3.0 CABLE RMA KIT, 6FT\r\n__________________\r\nCustomer Note\r\n26.07.2025          00:04:55             CPIC_SIMO (CPIC_SIMO)\r\n\r\nDoctor had existing Schick AE remote boxes and Schick 33 S2 sensor. He got a new Schick 33 S1 sensor almost 2 weeks ago that was shi\r\npped to him directly. He stated that since receiving it, the sensor was working intermittently and in the past few days it wasnt wo\r\nrking at all.\r\n\r\nI went in and connected the sensor to the remote box and the light for the sensor (on the box) did not come on in an\r\ny of the OPs and no sensor was detected on AE utility software. I changed the cord but still no connection. However the size 2 senso\r\nr works just fine.\r\n\r\nsensor serial #: 24029142\r\n\r\nCan I please get the part number for warranty replacement\r\n\r\n+++\r\n+++\r\n\r\n__________________\r\n\r\nProblem Description\r\n26.07.2025          00:04:54             CPIC_SIMO (CPIC_SIMO)\r\n\r\nDoctor had existing Schick AE remote boxes and Schick 33 S2 sensor. He got a new Schick 33 S1 sensor almost 2 weeks ago that was shi\r\npped to him directly. He stated that since receiving it, the sensor was working intermittently and in the past few days it wasnt wo\r\nrking at all.\r\n\r\nI went in and connected the sensor to the remote box and the light for the sensor (on the box) did not come on in an\r\ny of the OPs and no sensor was detected on AE utility software. I changed the cord but still no connection. However the size 2 senso\r\nr works just fine.\r\n\r\nsensor serial #: 24029142\r\n\r\nCan I please get the part number for warranty replacement\r\n\r\n+++\r\n+++\r\n\r\n__________________\r\n\r\nLog\r\n26.07.2025          00:04:54             CPIC_SIMO (CPIC_SIMO)",
